1
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:27,919
Be ready to answer to my sword of justice.

2
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:29,719
Osman!

3
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:32,239
I was born with a sword in my hand.

4
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,519
You cannot scare me with death!

5
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:38,679
We will either die or kill you all!

6
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:41,039
Do your best!

7
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:45,239
The one who is born with
a sword, dies by the sword.

8
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:49,919
I will teach you all of this
while I cut your head off.

9
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,599
For the Holy Roman Empire!

10
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:54,239
For the Holy Roman Empire! Alps!

11
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,799
Alps!

12
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,919
Attack!

13
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:21,199
O Healer.
O Healer.

14
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:23,239
They will recover God willing.

15
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,519
God willing.

16
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,399
Thanks to Allah.

17
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,719
Thanks to Allah.

18
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,639
The antidote is working, mother.

19
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:35,999
Good, thanks to Allah, my daughter.
-Mother...

20
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:39,839
What if my brother can't
take the antidote to my father?

21
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:50,599
My daughter. Think of good things
for good things to happen, alright?

22
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:53,039
We found the antidote thanks to Allah.

23
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:55,439
He will take it there in time, God willing.

24
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,799
Sisters! Come on

25
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,399
Bring lots of bottles!

26
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:03,359
This antidote will be sent everywhere, come on!

27
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:14,159
My Allah, make the wind a
wing and help Alaeddin go there.

28
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,077
God willing.

29
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:19,559
God willing he will give the antidote to my Osman.

30
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,759
Aameen.

31
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:14,639
Thank you.

32
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,599
He is about to die!

33
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,599
Don't let go!

34
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,279
Victory is ours!

35
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:25,639
Until your last drop of blood!

36
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:48,879
Brothers! This enemy is different! Stay strong!

37
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:51,119
Seems they ate their food well.

38
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:53,279
Don't let them defeat you, brothers!

39
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:55,079
Allah is the Greatest!

40
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:20,439
Osman Bey fell down!

41
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:30,599
My Osman!

42
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:43,279
Osman is on the ground!

43
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:52,079
Alps...

44
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,079
Alps...

45
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:15,079
I am here, my Bey! I will save you!

46
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:22,759
My Bey

47
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:41,119
Close the door.

48
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,479
Come here.

49
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,799
So... what happened?

50
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,919
What did you learn? Where is Osman?

51
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:50,279
I don't know where Osman is.

52
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:54,559
But Alaeddin went to give the antidote to him.

53
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:56,759
Where did he go?

54
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,719
I don't know.

55
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,919
You said he was lying half-dead.

56
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,079
Nobody is saying anything.

57
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:06,959
Yes..

58
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:12,679
Alaeddin is gone.

59
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:16,079
Osman is gone.

60
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:20,279
But if he recovers and comes back...

61
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,959
...we may not get this chance again.

62
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:32,519
Until Claudius and the emperor's army arrives...

63
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,599
...we will destroy Mudurnu from the inside.

64
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:43,599
What should we do?

65
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:51,079
We will kill Bala.

66
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:57,599
Now listen to me carefully.

67
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:03,759
I am here, my Bey! I'm here!

68
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:13,479
Thanks to Allah!

69
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,159
The antidote!

70
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,559
The antidote!

71
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:20,279
Stop that man! He brought the antidote!

72
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:26,679
Father!

73
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:27,999
Come on!

74
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,959
Stop!

75
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:41,119
Turgut Ghazi!

76
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,759
Antidote!

77
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:00,999
Father!

78
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,999
Come on! Come on!

79
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,999
Osman!

80
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,439
Osman... Osman...

81
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:20,439
Come on. You will be alright.

82
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:22,599
Drink this.

83
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:24,159
-Drink this.
-My Bey. My Bey!

84
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,119
-Drink this.
My Bey. My Bey!

85
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,799
O Healer.

86
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:39,359
Sofia, you are late!

87
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:41,839
Osman is still alive!

88
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:44,239
He's going to die with my sword!

89
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:47,239
Soldiers, attack!

90
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,399
Attack!

91
00:12:49,680 --> 00:12:53,039
My Bey! Alps, protect Osman Bey!

92
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:03,159
You will be alright.
You will be alright.

93
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,999
Father!

94
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,719
Father! Father.

95
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:29,719
Father, are you alright? Are you alright?

96
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,879
Get up, my Bey.

97
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,639
He's good.

98
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:43,159
-Praise be.
-Come on, my Bey. Come on.

99
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:49,679
Come on.

100
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,839
We're retreating.

101
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,999
Come on, come on.

102
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:06,199
Osman! Don't run away!

103
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,399
Faithless dogs!

104
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,519
Allah is the greatest!

105
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:44,479
Come on, warriors! Come on!

106
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:50,159
Stand up!

107
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:54,119
-Go after him!
-Come on!

108
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,679
We can't catch him.

109
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:01,999
Osman predicts every move we can make.

110
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:07,759
It will be the emperor's decision.

111
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:26,599
Allah Almighty speaks the truth.

112
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:42,239
My Allah, please heal my Osman.

113
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:46,279
Let them come back safely.

114
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:05,359
Sofia says hello, Bala.

115
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,039
Traitor.

116
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:13,039
Snake put you among us, huh?

117
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:16,959
You survived the poison but you'll die soon.

118
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:28,119
I won't kill you before you speak.

119
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:31,439
-Speak.
-Stupid Eleni.

120
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:33,479
You're going to die today, Bala.

121
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,359
Speak!

122
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:37,559
I will tell you.

123
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:40,479
Who? Who?

124
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,359
Mother.

125
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:45,279
Sisters are fainted.

126
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:50,119
Sisters, help!

127
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:55,359
Die, you snake.

128
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:04,318
Who? Who put you among us?

129
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,877
Tell me.

130
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:10,519
-Mother, your hand is bleeding.
-Bring the healer!

131
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,479
This snake can't die! Come on, speak.

132
00:17:12,598 --> 00:17:14,999
Tell me who put you among us.

133
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,759
What have you done, Yigit Bey?

134
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:32,799
She was going to tell everything.

135
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:38,399
I saw sisters and alps fainted at the door and...

136
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,999
..I saw blood on your hand...

137
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:45,199
...so I didn't know what to do, Bala Hatun.

138
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:48,959
-I could have made her fall with a slap!
-You are right.

139
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:53,119
Take her dead body away.

140
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:04,599
I don't know what to say, Bala Hatun.

141
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:12,439
For Allah's sake...
If something happened to you

142
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:17,919
...how could I explain it to Osman Bey?

143
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:22,479
It's not good but what happened happened.

144
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:26,239
You had your reasons.

145
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:29,559
Mother, your hand doesn't look well.

146
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:32,999
Let's get it examined.
-Alright.

147
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,919
-Welcome, my Bey.
-Welcome, my Bey.

148
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:02,679
-Osman Bey, welcome!
-Osman Bey, welcome!

149
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:05,319
-Thank you.
-Osman.

150
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:08,279
Are you alright?

151
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:11,599
I'm fine. Don't worry.

152
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:15,039
-Alaaddin brought the antidote.
-Thanks to Allah.

153
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:21,199
My Bey, where are you coming from like this?

154
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:25,479
We defeated the reinforcement
units of the emperor, Koca Bey.

155
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:37,479
My Bey, did you fight although you were poisoned?

156
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:40,399
Don't worry, Yigit Bey.

157
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:48,719
As long as I keep breathing, I will never stop.

158
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:53,199
Praise be, Praise be.

159
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:56,919
My Bey, if you want to rest...

160
00:19:57,640 --> 00:20:00,839
We only rest when we die, Bala.

161
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:02,999
Let's gather the war council!

162
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:04,399
As you order, my Bey.

163
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:06,239
As my Bey orders.

164
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:08,239
As you order, my Bey.

165
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:10,719
Turgut Ghazi.

166
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:14,279
You're coming with me.

167
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:29,559
Only a few knew that the army would come.

168
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:32,959
How could Osman know about it?

169
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:37,119
I don't know but I will find
out what he is planning.

170
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:43,479
Yigit.

171
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:46,479
Don't you suspect him?

172
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:48,759
No.

173
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:51,279
I'm sure it wasn't him.

174
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:56,959
You spoke surely about the poison saying they
could never find the antidote but they did.

175
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:59,199
Osman will recover.

176
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:01,319
Osman survived the poison.

177
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:04,919
But he can't survive the
death I prepared for him.

178
00:21:05,280 --> 00:21:07,479
You take the soldiers to Iznik.

179
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:11,759
I will meet Yigit and find out what happened.

180
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:37,839
Neither this water nor all the
rivers can put out the fire in my heart.

181
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:44,679
Before those two demons die, we
can't get rid of the dark clouds over us.

182
00:21:46,800 --> 00:21:52,359
Well... Things would have gone
terrible without you Turgut Ghazi.

183
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:56,119
Thank you, Osman.

184
00:21:56,320 --> 00:22:00,079
Our move has saved us for now.

185
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:05,319
We repelled their army, but...

186
00:22:05,840 --> 00:22:10,799
...we won't be safe until
we find the traitor among us.

187
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:18,959
He's such a traitor that he
manages to cover his tracks.

188
00:22:21,760 --> 00:22:25,079
A jackal disguising as a wolf.

189
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:28,919
What are you thinking of?

190
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:32,159
I think...

191
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:43,199
...he's breathing the same air with us.

192
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:46,039
Right next to us.

193
00:22:47,600 --> 00:22:54,079
During a war, I can't blame
the Beys for such thing.

194
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:59,279
We need every single alp. I can't do that.

195
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:06,079
Before the spy is exposed,
all of our plans will fail.

196
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:09,719
Tell me.

197
00:23:09,840 --> 00:23:13,119
What's in your mind?

198
00:23:14,120 --> 00:23:17,479
What are you planning to expose the traitor?

199
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:21,359
They'll think the state is sleeping.

200
00:23:21,560 --> 00:23:25,399
But the state never sleeps.

201
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:30,079
We'll see who is the traitor and who is the fool.

202
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:32,999
Let them think we're sleeping.

203
00:23:33,760 --> 00:23:37,479
When it's time, when they make a mistake,

204
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:40,159
...their heads will fall at our feet.

205
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:43,479
-For sure.
-Do I have permission, my Bey?

206
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:46,479
Come in.

207
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:51,999
Beys are ready, my Bey.

208
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:58,319
Attention! Osman Bey!

209
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:02,559
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

210
00:24:06,760 --> 00:24:08,719
Praise be.

211
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:11,799
The poison's effect is gone.

212
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:19,079
Allah protected you for your
family and for the state, Osman Bey.

213
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:21,959
Thank you, Koca Bey, thank you.

214
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:25,679
Thank you.

215
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:29,399
Byzantium which is a threat to our existence...

216
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:35,199
Even if we pushed them back for
now, we have not yet defeated them.

217
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:42,039
The Emperor's guards will
come at us while we are struggling.

218
00:24:42,040 --> 00:24:47,799
That is why I want to ask something, Osman Bey.

219
00:24:47,800 --> 00:24:54,279
Did the head of our state see
our mistake or weakness that...

220
00:24:54,280 --> 00:24:59,119
...he went into battle without telling us?

221
00:24:59,120 --> 00:25:03,999
My Bey, we said the way and the target are one.

222
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:10,279
-But when you went without calling us...
-I fully trust my Beys.

223
00:25:10,280 --> 00:25:14,839
But hard times require quick decisions.

224
00:25:14,840 --> 00:25:17,999
Since we don't know where
the enemy will attack from...

225
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:21,439
...it was necessary for you to stay in Mudurnu.

226
00:25:22,800 --> 00:25:29,359
We went in secret and pushed back their armies.

227
00:25:29,360 --> 00:25:32,879
Thank you, Osman Bey.

228
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:35,919
My Bey, what should we do now?

229
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:38,519
Whatever we do, we must be quick.

230
00:25:38,520 --> 00:25:39,999
What is your order?

231
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:44,679
No, speed is for horses.

232
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:48,919
A wolf always waits for the right time.

233
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:56,319
Now if the enemy attacks us..

234
00:25:58,560 --> 00:26:02,719
...it will be from Mudurnu or Goynuk.

235
00:26:04,760 --> 00:26:12,279
These places are both on the road to
Iznik and on their most important lands.

236
00:26:12,280 --> 00:26:16,679
So my decision is this.

237
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:20,319
We will wait for them in Mudurnu.

238
00:26:20,320 --> 00:26:25,119
Beys, gather all your men inside Mudurnu.

239
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:33,279
We will face the enemy with all our strength.

240
00:26:38,800 --> 00:26:44,599
Wherever Claudius attacks from, he
must pass through Mudurnu's borders.

241
00:26:44,600 --> 00:26:48,599
When he shows himself, we will stop him, my Bey.

242
00:26:48,600 --> 00:26:52,039
We will gather all the Alps in Mudurnu.

243
00:26:52,040 --> 00:26:54,799
A big storm will break out.

244
00:26:54,800 --> 00:27:00,919
But we will not die without fighting.

245
00:27:00,920 --> 00:27:02,399
As you order, my Bey.

246
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:05,159
You may leave.

247
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:24,239
What happened?

248
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:27,519
My Bey.
-Yes.

249
00:27:27,520 --> 00:27:31,279
Come here.

250
00:27:31,440 --> 00:27:36,399
You check around.

251
00:27:39,560 --> 00:27:43,559
Claudius wants to see me.

252
00:27:43,560 --> 00:27:45,239
Bring my horse.

253
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:57,959
The poison weakened the
strength of the Alps, Koca Bey.

254
00:27:57,960 --> 00:28:00,799
The Emperor's army is about to attack.

255
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:04,999
The Turk's fate is written by war, Hasan Bey.

256
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:07,679
I'm not afraid of war, Koca Bey.

257
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:10,719
But I don't want to lose either.

258
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:12,679
You heard Osman Bey.

259
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:15,919
My Alps in Goynuk are alright.

260
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:17,639
Tell Yigit.

261
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:21,159
He will help you with Mudurnu's defense.

262
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:27,399
Until the Alps come from my
tribe, it's good to be cautious.

263
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:30,159
You thought well, Hasan Bey.

264
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:33,279
May it be easy. Thank you.

265
00:28:33,280 --> 00:28:35,679
Thank you Koca Bey.

266
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:43,279
If anyone asks about me, tell them
I'll be back after checking the horses.

267
00:28:43,280 --> 00:28:46,039
Come on.

268
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:49,879
Yigit Bey.

269
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:52,039
Where are you going?

270
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:03,559
Bring my horse.

271
00:29:03,560 --> 00:29:07,119
Come on!

272
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:18,199
Hasan Bey.

273
00:29:21,480 --> 00:29:23,919
Cerkutay Bey.

274
00:29:37,600 --> 00:29:40,359
I know your pain.

275
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:45,319
But I have nothing to say to you.

276
00:29:53,600 --> 00:29:57,879
You don't even know what shame is, huh, Hasan?

277
00:29:58,040 --> 00:30:00,519
Alps, stop!

278
00:30:00,520 --> 00:30:02,839
My Hatun was martyred.

279
00:30:02,840 --> 00:30:08,439
Many families were torn apart because of you.

280
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:13,119
Cerkutay Bey, you heard about the poison.

281
00:30:13,120 --> 00:30:16,759
Those dastards planned everything.

282
00:30:16,760 --> 00:30:19,799
What were you going to do?

283
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:25,479
What were you going to do?

284
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:29,999
But look, you're still here.

285
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:32,559
You're still breathing.

286
00:30:35,600 --> 00:30:40,759
Enough

287
00:30:40,760 --> 00:30:43,119
What do you want, huh?

288
00:30:43,120 --> 00:30:45,439
Do you want my life?

289
00:30:45,880 --> 00:30:47,199
Take it.

290
00:30:48,360 --> 00:30:50,479
What are you doing?

291
00:30:50,760 --> 00:30:53,159
Stop!

292
00:30:53,160 --> 00:30:55,159
What happened to you, huh?

293
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:59,079
Does doing this in front of our people suit you?

294
00:30:59,080 --> 00:31:04,079
Osman Bey will hear you now.

295
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:22,239
This is not over.

296
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:27,199
You will pay for it.

297
00:31:49,800 --> 00:31:51,999
What happened to your hand?

298
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:58,999
It's nothing. I'll tell you.

299
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:02,239
What do you mean nothing?

300
00:32:02,240 --> 00:32:08,399
That helper girl of Yigit Bey, Eleni.
The girl who came from Goynuk.

301
00:32:08,400 --> 00:32:09,759
Right?

302
00:32:10,960 --> 00:32:14,359
She was a spy for Sofia. She tried to kill me.

303
00:32:19,760 --> 00:32:24,279
If she was talking to Sofia, she
might have been a part of this betrayal.

304
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:28,703
It would have been
good if we could make her speak,

305
00:32:28,715 --> 00:32:31,519
but Yigit Bey killed
her at the last moment.

306
00:32:35,840 --> 00:32:38,319
Tell me what happened.

307
00:32:48,600 --> 00:32:49,719
Claudius

308
00:32:51,280 --> 00:32:54,359
Osman is waiting for you, take precautions...

309
00:32:56,680 --> 00:32:59,319
You said Osman was going to die?

310
00:32:59,320 --> 00:33:01,559
You said he was poisoned?

311
00:33:01,560 --> 00:33:05,519
He destroyed half of my army.

312
00:33:05,520 --> 00:33:09,559
He escaped from the claws of Azrael.

313
00:33:09,560 --> 00:33:14,519
He should not have been able to fight.

314
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:21,799
How did he learn about the emperor's guards?

315
00:33:21,800 --> 00:33:24,239
Why didn't you tell me?

316
00:33:24,840 --> 00:33:29,039
He left secretly. I didn't know.

317
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:33,959
He suspects that there is a spy among us.

318
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:38,719
Claudius, our fate is the same.

319
00:33:38,720 --> 00:33:42,799
Luck is on their side, but they will die.

320
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:48,879
What about Bala?

321
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:53,999
She is alive. Osman is taking
precautions against your armies.

322
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:56,119
What precautions?

323
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:59,039
He thinks you will attack the Mudurnu line.

324
00:33:59,360 --> 00:34:04,719
So he is sending all his Alps to Mudurnu.

325
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:10,559
But these precautions won't save
him from the death written in his fate.

326
00:34:17,199 --> 00:34:20,918
My beautiful sisters. Our father is alright.

327
00:34:21,719 --> 00:34:25,119
He will be better when he rests, God willing.

328
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:29,958
My Hatun, do you see?

329
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:34,759
They don't know their father at all.

330
00:34:35,800 --> 00:34:38,678
Didn't I tell you not to be afraid?

331
00:34:41,760 --> 00:34:46,079
We are daughters of Osman Bey. We never fear.

332
00:34:46,080 --> 00:34:49,279
But of course, we were worried, father.

333
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:52,039
We could not help it, father.

334
00:34:52,040 --> 00:34:53,638
Well well...

335
00:34:56,239 --> 00:35:00,159
A rose blooms, and the garden becomes beautiful.

336
00:35:00,160 --> 00:35:03,279
A girl grows up, and the
homeland becomes beautiful.

337
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:09,759
As long as you are with me...

338
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:11,839
...no one can defeat me.

339
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:12,879
No one.

340
00:35:13,720 --> 00:35:15,399
Come on now, go sit.

341
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:20,079
Sit..

342
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:37,599
Ah Ulgen, how will we get used to your absence?

343
00:35:45,640 --> 00:35:50,479
See... Death is always beside us.

344
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:57,759
We learned to live with it,
and we will continue to learn.

345
00:35:59,880 --> 00:36:04,159
May Allah show her mercy.
Ulgen has now reached Allah.

346
00:36:04,160 --> 00:36:09,359
May Allah show her mercy.

347
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:16,479
Of course people feel sorry
for those who pass away.

348
00:36:18,160 --> 00:36:21,559
But they feel even more sorry
for the ones who are left behind.

349
00:36:21,560 --> 00:36:28,759
The deceased reach Allah,
but the living feel longing, father.

350
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:34,559
Of course, of course.

351
00:36:34,560 --> 00:36:37,559
Cerkutay and Ghazi.

352
00:36:37,560 --> 00:36:40,159
We shouldn't leave them alone.

353
00:36:40,160 --> 00:36:42,719
I invited them here to share our meal.

354
00:36:42,720 --> 00:36:46,639
But Cerkutay Bey wants to be alone, father.

355
00:36:48,120 --> 00:36:52,959
Let them be alone for now. But
later, let them know we are with them.

356
00:37:29,520 --> 00:37:30,719
Step back...

357
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:32,759
Ghazi..

358
00:37:34,160 --> 00:37:37,399
Cerkutay!

359
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:41,719
I'll kill you...

360
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:47,079
Again?

361
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:54,359
Again?

362
00:38:02,680 --> 00:38:04,759
What am I going to do now?

363
00:38:12,160 --> 00:38:15,039
My Allah... Help me.

364
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:19,039
My Allah, help me...

365
00:38:45,200 --> 00:38:49,879
They left me helpless and
miserable, Turgut Ghazi.

366
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:56,399
They took my heart out of my body.

367
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:08,879
They left me alone with this innocent child.

368
00:39:15,200 --> 00:39:17,799
What am I going to do now?

369
00:39:19,160 --> 00:39:23,119
What cold water should I drink
to put out the fire in my heart?

370
00:39:25,520 --> 00:39:33,039
How will I resist without
my wife, without my Hatun?

371
00:39:33,040 --> 00:39:34,679
What am I going to do?

372
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:49,279
Our destiny is only in the power of Allah.

373
00:39:51,480 --> 00:39:56,279
Death and life are only in His hands, Cerkutay.

374
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:06,399
Take it out.

375
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:10,799
Take my heart out, Turgut Ghazi.

376
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:15,079
I... I cannot endure this pain again.

377
00:40:15,080 --> 00:40:20,319
What am I going to do, how will I endure this?

378
00:40:21,200 --> 00:40:23,959
By believing, Cerkutay.

379
00:40:23,960 --> 00:40:25,799
By believing

380
00:40:29,040 --> 00:40:30,919
You know that...

381
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:39,399
...we will all go to our real homeland one day.

382
00:40:41,760 --> 00:40:47,559
This world is a test for all of us, my son.

383
00:40:51,360 --> 00:40:57,439
Pain and suffering will end when that time comes.

384
00:41:06,920 --> 00:41:09,279
Do not..

385
00:41:09,280 --> 00:41:12,639
...do not fall into rebellion.

386
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:18,119
It's Allah Who gives and takes.

387
00:41:24,080 --> 00:41:26,879
Look there.

388
00:41:28,120 --> 00:41:32,639
You have a great boy growing up.

389
00:41:34,440 --> 00:41:37,599
Despair would never suit you.

390
00:41:38,080 --> 00:41:40,279
Pull yourself together.

391
00:42:06,440 --> 00:42:12,199
My brother Bamsi once looked after you.

392
00:42:22,680 --> 00:42:25,759
Now I will help you.

393
00:42:27,680 --> 00:42:29,839
Everything will be alright, boy.

394
00:42:30,440 --> 00:42:32,359
Everything will be alright.

395
00:42:56,560 --> 00:43:00,959
I will take Mudurnu and
Goynuk back from vile Osman.

396
00:43:01,280 --> 00:43:03,039
He knows about the army.

397
00:43:03,200 --> 00:43:05,279
He'll take more measures.

398
00:43:05,440 --> 00:43:06,799
Definitely.

399
00:43:07,000 --> 00:43:13,879
But I will hit him in such a
spot that he will lose everything.

400
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:19,479
What did you learn, Claudius?

401
00:43:19,560 --> 00:43:24,599
My emperor, Osman has
gathered his army in Mudurnu.

402
00:43:24,840 --> 00:43:26,959
He's taking measures there.

403
00:43:27,280 --> 00:43:29,639
As we predicted.

404
00:43:30,560 --> 00:43:33,759
-How did he know about the army?
-Yigit doesn't know either.

405
00:43:34,400 --> 00:43:36,639
He said Osman left secretly.

406
00:43:36,720 --> 00:43:39,439
He suspects that there is a traitor among them.

407
00:43:39,600 --> 00:43:42,479
So heâ€™s more cautious these days.

408
00:43:43,200 --> 00:43:47,439
He'll do everything to defend Mudurnu and Goynuk.

409
00:43:48,080 --> 00:43:52,479
He will tire our army and then attack.

410
00:43:53,200 --> 00:43:57,879
Then... While he is expecting
us in Mudurnu and Goynuk,

411
00:43:58,160 --> 00:44:00,839
...we should capture Kayi Tribe.

412
00:44:01,040 --> 00:44:04,759
We'll hit him in the unexpected spot, huh?

413
00:44:05,480 --> 00:44:12,159
If he loses his tribe, he will lose
the trust of all his beys and people.

414
00:44:13,160 --> 00:44:16,959
When he loses his tribe, we will
isolate Osman from the others.

415
00:44:17,120 --> 00:44:23,239
So it will be easier to
capture Mudurnu and Goynuk.

416
00:44:23,360 --> 00:44:26,719
And nobody will know this until tomorrow.

417
00:44:26,840 --> 00:44:28,079
Even not the army.

418
00:44:28,200 --> 00:44:31,279
You'll tell them on the way.

419
00:44:31,600 --> 00:44:33,839
Yes, my Emperor.

420
00:44:39,160 --> 00:44:41,079
Great Emperor, the army are ready.

421
00:44:41,120 --> 00:44:42,639
Waiting for your orders.

422
00:44:42,640 --> 00:44:44,359
Let them wait for my decision.

423
00:44:44,480 --> 00:44:49,239
Claudius and Sofia will tell
them about the target in Akcebe.

424
00:44:49,720 --> 00:44:51,999
They should have a good rest tonight.

425
00:44:52,120 --> 00:44:53,999
Of course.

426
00:44:59,360 --> 00:45:02,359
Do I have permission, my Bey?
-Come in, Alaaddin.

427
00:45:05,120 --> 00:45:09,439
My Bey, the sick are regaining
strength thanks to Allah.

428
00:45:09,600 --> 00:45:13,879
-Thank Allah.
-Good. Alaaddin.

429
00:45:14,440 --> 00:45:16,239
Go to our tribe immediately.

430
00:45:16,240 --> 00:45:19,559
As you order, my Bey.
We'll leave before the azan.

431
00:45:20,440 --> 00:45:23,319
You're still thinking about
the battlefield, Osman.

432
00:45:23,320 --> 00:45:24,839
What do you think?

433
00:45:24,880 --> 00:45:29,639
The battle isn't in the field but in minds, Bala.

434
00:45:29,680 --> 00:45:33,559
We've defeated the heathens
for now. But they won't stop.

435
00:45:35,200 --> 00:45:43,559
The traitor among us will tell them our
troops are in Mudurnu and Goynuk now.

436
00:45:45,960 --> 00:45:52,559
You say they will leave Mudurnu and
Goynuk for now and march to other targets.

437
00:45:53,960 --> 00:45:57,239
Where do you think they'll attack, my Bey?

438
00:45:58,280 --> 00:46:01,599
Kayi Tribe which they think is unprotected.

439
00:46:02,360 --> 00:46:07,399
But that will be their death.

440
00:46:08,600 --> 00:46:10,039
My Bey.

441
00:46:10,640 --> 00:46:15,759
Pardon me but what if they don't
get deceived but make another move?

442
00:46:15,960 --> 00:46:17,679
The spy in the council.

443
00:46:17,960 --> 00:46:20,519
He only knows what I said.

444
00:46:20,640 --> 00:46:25,639
So they will think we are
taking measures in Mudurnu.

445
00:46:26,120 --> 00:46:30,759
In fact, all of our weapons are in Kayi Tribe.

446
00:46:32,880 --> 00:46:37,439
So the enemy will think
our forces are in Mudurnu.

447
00:46:37,560 --> 00:46:41,759
But they will walk into the trap.

448
00:46:42,600 --> 00:46:47,919
Then we should wait for the
enemy to come into our trap.

449
00:46:48,520 --> 00:46:50,679
There is a traitor among us.

450
00:46:50,800 --> 00:46:53,639
Beys will know nothing.

451
00:46:53,960 --> 00:46:56,799
Only we know about this.

452
00:47:12,600 --> 00:47:14,639
Alps are standing ready, Koca Bey.

453
00:47:15,080 --> 00:47:19,479
Mudurnu has become a shield of alps, for sure.

454
00:47:19,680 --> 00:47:26,719
The hammer swords of the enemy will be
broken on that anvil-like shield, Hasan Bey.

455
00:47:26,760 --> 00:47:28,799
God willing, Koca Bey.

456
00:47:29,120 --> 00:47:32,279
Yigit Bey... Where is Yigit Bey?

457
00:47:32,760 --> 00:47:34,479
Checking the alps.

458
00:47:35,800 --> 00:47:37,119
Why?

459
00:47:37,720 --> 00:47:42,879
We should take measures in case of
another riot Christian people may start.

460
00:47:43,960 --> 00:47:47,319
His odalisque Eleni turned out to be a betrayer.

461
00:47:47,560 --> 00:47:52,119
People may be suspicious about him.

462
00:47:53,000 --> 00:47:55,639
Keep him away from this, Hasan Bey.

463
00:47:55,920 --> 00:47:57,759
Okay, Koca Bey.

464
00:47:57,840 --> 00:48:01,159
I'll give information to Osman
Bey and then take measures.

465
00:48:05,640 --> 00:48:09,159
None of Osman Bey's alps is here.

466
00:48:11,440 --> 00:48:13,799
Why is that?

467
00:48:18,640 --> 00:48:22,719
-We'll talk to Osman Bey.
-Osman Bey isn't here.

468
00:48:23,360 --> 00:48:25,079
Not here?

469
00:48:28,880 --> 00:48:31,599
Where is Osman Bey going?

470
00:49:20,360 --> 00:49:22,919
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

471
00:49:50,680 --> 00:49:55,119
Oghuz, empty the carts in the square.

472
00:49:55,480 --> 00:49:57,439
As you order, Alaaddin Bey.

473
00:49:57,560 --> 00:50:00,439
Alps, you go take your positions.

474
00:50:00,680 --> 00:50:03,359
As you order, my Bey.

475
00:50:04,400 --> 00:50:08,799
Fatma, let's start the preparations quickly.

476
00:50:09,200 --> 00:50:12,279
-May your work be easy.
-Thank you.

477
00:50:16,800 --> 00:50:20,119
Sisters, are you ready?

478
00:50:20,320 --> 00:50:23,199
Let me see. Show me.

479
00:50:23,680 --> 00:50:25,359
Praise be.

480
00:50:32,480 --> 00:50:35,399
Come on, alps! Come on!

481
00:50:41,760 --> 00:50:43,959
Hurry, come on

482
00:50:44,000 --> 00:50:45,519
Come on.

483
00:50:47,280 --> 00:50:49,239
Open it.

484
00:50:51,400 --> 00:50:53,119
Good.

485
00:50:53,560 --> 00:50:55,599
Here we go.

486
00:51:00,240 --> 00:51:02,399
Shahzade Alaaddin.

487
00:51:02,720 --> 00:51:03,999
Boy.

488
00:51:04,240 --> 00:51:05,679
What are you doing here?

489
00:51:05,920 --> 00:51:09,759
The enemy are coming, my
Shahzade. I want to fight too.

490
00:51:10,120 --> 00:51:13,039
Praise be. Praise be.

491
00:51:13,200 --> 00:51:17,399
The brave of my tribe listen to me.

492
00:51:17,960 --> 00:51:20,399
A sword cuts a heart out.

493
00:51:20,640 --> 00:51:23,079
Some words require a heart to say.

494
00:51:23,200 --> 00:51:25,999
We need to stand united during a war.

495
00:51:26,160 --> 00:51:31,759
But your duty in this war is
defending your own family, alright?

496
00:51:31,960 --> 00:51:34,279
-Yes.
-Good boy.

497
00:51:34,440 --> 00:51:36,159
My boy.

498
00:51:36,480 --> 00:51:41,159
My boy, family is the most precious treasure.

499
00:51:41,640 --> 00:51:44,999
You protect your family and
we protect our tribe, alright?

500
00:51:45,480 --> 00:51:47,999
-Yes.
Let me kiss you.

501
00:51:50,480 --> 00:51:53,559
My brave boy. Praise be.

502
00:51:58,040 --> 00:52:00,279
Well, hatun...

503
00:52:00,600 --> 00:52:06,119
As long as everybody, the elder and
the young, loves homeland so much,

504
00:52:06,640 --> 00:52:08,799
...Turks will make history.

505
00:52:08,800 --> 00:52:12,319
The whole world will be a path
for them to follow, thank Allah.

506
00:52:12,360 --> 00:52:13,959
Thank Allah.

507
00:52:16,080 --> 00:52:22,239
May Allah give us children to run in
that path for our cause, Alaaddin Ali.

508
00:52:22,640 --> 00:52:24,559
God willing, hatun.

509
00:52:24,880 --> 00:52:27,879
God willing.

510
00:52:28,840 --> 00:52:31,599
-Here we go.
Well... Come on.

511
00:52:50,160 --> 00:52:53,679
Sir, Osman's Shahzade and
daughters have gone to their tribe.

512
00:52:53,920 --> 00:52:58,039
They are just a few. And there
are only ordinary people in the tribe.

513
00:53:00,760 --> 00:53:03,919
It's good that Alaaddin is in the tribe.

514
00:53:04,240 --> 00:53:08,679
Today, Osman is going to
lose both his tribe and children.

515
00:53:10,160 --> 00:53:12,519
Well, Poena...

516
00:53:12,960 --> 00:53:16,359
Who you chose instead
of me will bring your death.

517
00:53:17,080 --> 00:53:20,679
Although you raised her, she is a Turk.

518
00:53:20,840 --> 00:53:23,279
It's not surprising that she's a fool.

519
00:53:26,440 --> 00:53:30,359
She is a Turk.

520
00:53:31,160 --> 00:53:33,999
The day she chose Bala
and Osman, she killed Poena.

521
00:53:34,120 --> 00:53:36,599
I'm going to kill her myself.

522
00:53:36,760 --> 00:53:38,359
Good.

523
00:53:38,920 --> 00:53:40,599
Today is the vengeance day.

524
00:53:40,920 --> 00:53:44,239
The day when Osman is going to writhe in pain.

525
00:53:44,680 --> 00:53:47,599
Let's get started. Come on.

526
00:53:48,320 --> 00:53:50,679
Come on.

527
00:53:58,840 --> 00:54:00,879
Fatma Hatun.

528
00:54:00,880 --> 00:54:04,119
Sister. Oguz Bey wants to tell you something.

529
00:54:04,120 --> 00:54:07,199
I was going to ask if you
need anything or need help.

530
00:54:07,200 --> 00:54:10,159
No, thank you. Come on Halime.

531
00:54:10,160 --> 00:54:11,599
But we need help.

532
00:54:11,600 --> 00:54:14,439
There is really a lot of work here, sister.

533
00:54:14,440 --> 00:54:17,239
I will help with the work
here, you stay here, huh?

534
00:54:19,200 --> 00:54:20,839
Halime.

535
00:54:22,280 --> 00:54:24,239
Halime.

536
00:54:25,120 --> 00:54:27,359
I am sorry...

537
00:54:27,360 --> 00:54:32,239
We can do it but you know
better what to do, Fatma Hatun.

538
00:54:32,240 --> 00:54:33,959
Guide us.

539
00:54:33,960 --> 00:54:37,639
I do. But my brother gave the duty to you.

540
00:54:37,640 --> 00:54:39,679
Now I should not interfere.

541
00:54:39,680 --> 00:54:43,279
As soon as you came back to the
tribe, you became yourself again, Kayi...

542
00:54:45,320 --> 00:54:49,759
I mean, Fatma Hatun, it
seems our hostility continues.

543
00:54:50,200 --> 00:54:54,279
No. Why would there be a
hostility between us, Oguz Bey?

544
00:55:01,480 --> 00:55:06,439
But I should warn you. My brother will
not care whether you are crazy or not.

545
00:55:06,440 --> 00:55:09,679
If he sees something wrong,
he answers accordingly.

546
00:55:09,680 --> 00:55:14,279
Gather those arrows, they
should all be in an order.

547
00:55:17,840 --> 00:55:20,639
I am again the crazy one, thanks to Allah.

548
00:55:21,880 --> 00:55:26,959
But you started it. If you didn't
talk, I would have kept walking.

549
00:55:26,960 --> 00:55:30,639
No. I have no complaint.

550
00:55:30,640 --> 00:55:34,319
If you want, you can call me
crazy until evening. I accept it.

551
00:55:42,320 --> 00:55:44,319
My Shahzade.

552
00:55:44,320 --> 00:55:48,119
Claudius and Sofia. They
are coming with their armies.

553
00:55:48,120 --> 00:55:49,679
Dastards.

554
00:55:50,640 --> 00:55:54,039
Oguz, take precautions.

555
00:55:54,040 --> 00:55:58,839
If they are coming, they will pay for it.

556
00:56:25,840 --> 00:56:31,119
Kayi tribe will now become Byzantine land.

557
00:56:31,120 --> 00:56:34,679
Battering ram!

558
00:57:17,280 --> 00:57:23,719
That Osman you trust won't be able to save you!

559
00:57:43,120 --> 00:57:45,839
You came to your death, dogs.

560
00:57:45,840 --> 00:57:48,239
Come on, brothers!

561
00:57:48,240 --> 00:57:49,919
Ya Allah!

562
00:57:49,920 --> 00:57:51,599
Attack!

563
00:58:18,040 --> 00:58:20,399
Allah is the Greatest!

564
00:58:54,160 --> 00:58:55,959
Attack Alps!

565
00:58:55,960 --> 00:58:59,359
Today is the day of shahada
but we will not surrender!

566
00:59:17,000 --> 00:59:20,919
Devils... you will not win

567
00:59:23,480 --> 00:59:25,639
Allah is the Greatest!

568
00:59:25,640 --> 00:59:27,839
Alps! Stand tall!

569
00:59:33,720 --> 00:59:36,119
Alps! Step back!

570
00:59:37,600 --> 00:59:41,319
Alps! Step back!

571
00:59:43,360 --> 00:59:45,439
Allah is the Greatest!

572
01:00:15,320 --> 01:00:17,999
Alps! We are retreating!

573
01:00:18,000 --> 01:00:19,919
Bring the shields!

574
01:00:26,760 --> 01:00:29,039
You won't be able to escape!

575
01:00:33,320 --> 01:00:37,759
Turks, your end has come!

576
01:00:47,320 --> 01:00:51,599
I will take all your heads
and send them to Osman!

577
01:00:52,920 --> 01:00:56,799
Don't worry, we will send him to hell too.

578
01:01:14,120 --> 01:01:16,639
You are the people of hell.

579
01:01:16,640 --> 01:01:19,559
But I will be the one to send you there.

580
01:01:36,800 --> 01:01:40,359
Hristo.

581
01:01:46,160 --> 01:01:47,999
Tell me Hristo.

582
01:01:48,000 --> 01:01:50,399
What is the emperor's new target?

583
01:01:50,400 --> 01:01:54,279
The emperor will attack the Kayi
tribe with all his power, Osman Bey.

584
01:01:55,920 --> 01:01:59,439
Just as you said, they fell for your game.

585
01:01:59,440 --> 01:02:02,559
What is your order now, my Osman?

586
01:02:02,560 --> 01:02:04,959
That place will be their grave.

587
01:02:09,200 --> 01:02:13,159
Both of you are no longer human, you are demons.

588
01:02:14,360 --> 01:02:17,279
You deserve death!

589
01:02:17,280 --> 01:02:18,639
Traitor!

590
01:02:30,480 --> 01:02:33,239
They call me Solgur Agha.

591
01:02:33,240 --> 01:02:38,519
Whoever sets his eyes on the shadow
of the Turk is destined to be destroyed.

592
01:02:38,520 --> 01:02:43,239
All oppressors must know this!

593
01:02:43,240 --> 01:02:51,199
Even if the jackal speaks
first, I always say the last word.

594
01:02:52,680 --> 01:02:57,359
You planned a game.

595
01:02:57,360 --> 01:02:59,879
But you fell into a trap.

596
01:03:00,360 --> 01:03:03,959
Now it is time to pay for what you have done.

597
01:03:03,960 --> 01:03:07,799
Where will you escape now, Sofia?

598
01:03:09,880 --> 01:03:16,799
I swear, we will make you pay
for everything you have done to us.

599
01:03:22,520 --> 01:03:26,039
Alps! Attack!

600
01:04:46,680 --> 01:04:48,079
Poena..

601
01:04:48,080 --> 01:04:50,919
Not Poena, Halime!

602
01:05:13,680 --> 01:05:16,879
My little angel of revenge..

603
01:05:37,400 --> 01:05:39,999
Allah is the Greatest!

604
01:05:45,880 --> 01:05:47,799
Allah is the Greatest!

605
01:05:48,800 --> 01:05:51,359
Allah is the Greatest!

606
01:05:58,680 --> 01:06:05,279
Today, you will get your
share from Solgur Agha's furor.

607
01:06:38,720 --> 01:06:40,719
Allah is the Greatest!

608
01:06:52,320 --> 01:06:53,959
Sofia!

609
01:06:53,960 --> 01:06:56,799
We will either run away or die here!

610
01:06:56,800 --> 01:06:58,799
It's not over yet, Claudius!

611
01:06:58,800 --> 01:07:00,199
Come on!

612
01:07:41,360 --> 01:07:47,839
The end of those who attack Osman
Bey's tribe is death, you dastards.

613
01:08:06,720 --> 01:08:09,039
Attack, valiants!

614
01:08:09,040 --> 01:08:11,919
These demons will die here today!

615
01:08:11,920 --> 01:08:13,799
Allah is the Greatest!

616
01:08:18,040 --> 01:08:21,879
Sofia! Yunus! Give me the bow and the arrows!

617
01:08:39,600 --> 01:08:42,439
Osman, Osman... They are running away!

618
01:08:42,439 --> 01:08:44,759
They cannot go anywhere!

619
01:08:44,760 --> 01:08:45,999
They will die today!

620
01:08:46,000 --> 01:08:47,679
Alps! Bring the horses!

621
01:08:57,319 --> 01:08:58,839
Come on!

622
01:09:07,120 --> 01:09:08,599
Halime.

623
01:09:17,200 --> 01:09:18,439
Halime!

624
01:09:18,439 --> 01:09:19,999
Halime, are you alright?

625
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:21,919
Get up! Are you alright?
-I am alright.

626
01:09:21,920 --> 01:09:23,999
My Halime, you have just recovered.

627
01:09:24,000 --> 01:09:25,519
Go to your tent now.

628
01:09:25,520 --> 01:09:27,278
The sword... Here, take my sword...

629
01:09:27,279 --> 01:09:30,118
Come on, my rose! Come on!

630
01:09:41,800 --> 01:09:45,959
Osman was going to wait for them in Mudurnu.

631
01:09:47,120 --> 01:09:49,719
He played a game.

632
01:09:49,720 --> 01:09:53,158
How did that happen?

633
01:09:53,160 --> 01:09:54,999
What are we going to do now, my Bey?

634
01:09:55,000 --> 01:09:57,039
I don't know what we are going to do.

635
01:10:05,280 --> 01:10:09,759
Won't the enemy attack
the Mudurnu line, Koca Bey?

636
01:10:09,760 --> 01:10:13,359
Why do you think Osman
Bey called the Beys to his tribe?

637
01:10:13,400 --> 01:10:16,239
There is something strange...
But I don't know what it is.

638
01:10:16,240 --> 01:10:19,599
We will find out once we talk to Osman Bey.

639
01:10:20,120 --> 01:10:22,119
Okay.

640
01:10:38,240 --> 01:10:40,479
Claudius!

641
01:10:40,480 --> 01:10:42,239
Sofia, you go!

642
01:10:42,240 --> 01:10:44,399
I can deal with them alone!

643
01:10:46,640 --> 01:10:47,399
No!

644
01:10:47,400 --> 01:10:50,279
Sofia. There will be no
betrayal this time, believe me!

645
01:10:50,280 --> 01:10:52,639
Go now! Go!

646
01:10:52,640 --> 01:10:55,039
Come on!

647
01:11:00,320 --> 01:11:01,439
Sofia.

648
01:11:02,880 --> 01:11:04,959
Come here Sofia!

649
01:11:04,960 --> 01:11:06,879
Come on!

650
01:11:06,880 --> 01:11:08,719
Foolish Claudius...

651
01:11:09,200 --> 01:11:16,199
Your foolish bravery made you face me, huh?

652
01:11:20,080 --> 01:11:26,719
Finally, it is time to face each other, Osman.

653
01:11:26,720 --> 01:11:31,959
I really don't want your
dirty body to lie on this land.

654
01:11:31,960 --> 01:11:36,119
But... But you will die.

655
01:11:44,360 --> 01:11:46,639
Soldier!

656
01:11:48,960 --> 01:11:51,799
Sofia!

657
01:11:59,200 --> 01:12:01,119
Sofia.

658
01:12:02,000 --> 01:12:03,599
Go Sofia...

659
01:12:11,760 --> 01:12:14,159
Slowly.

660
01:12:46,120 --> 01:12:48,719
Just wait.

661
01:12:50,680 --> 01:12:52,959
Just wait.

662
01:12:53,680 --> 01:12:55,679
Get your hand off.

663
01:13:08,520 --> 01:13:12,919
Both that traitor and you are going to die.

664
01:13:16,120 --> 01:13:18,199
So you know.

665
01:13:18,800 --> 01:13:22,359
But you'll never find out who he is.

666
01:13:23,080 --> 01:13:24,759
You think so?

667
01:13:25,040 --> 01:13:26,919
Huh?

668
01:13:37,320 --> 01:13:39,519
Get up.

669
01:13:41,920 --> 01:13:42,719
Who?

670
01:13:46,880 --> 01:13:48,679
You'll tell me.

671
01:13:50,160 --> 01:13:52,199
You say so?

672
01:13:55,560 --> 01:14:00,999
It's weird that you're trying to get information
from a man who is going to die shortly.

673
01:14:01,360 --> 01:14:07,479
Both you and that traitor
will taste my sword of justice.

674
01:14:12,320 --> 01:14:18,279
To make an example. I'll kill
you in the square of Kayi Tribe.

675
01:14:18,600 --> 01:14:21,479
Get up.

676
01:14:27,200 --> 01:14:29,079
Move.

677
01:14:30,520 --> 01:14:32,439
Osman..

678
01:14:33,880 --> 01:14:37,039
...is taking Claudius to his tribe.

679
01:14:37,160 --> 01:14:40,559
-What if he gives your name to Osman, my Bey?
-No way.

680
01:14:44,640 --> 01:14:52,639
Then my grave will be prepared
next to Claudius' grave, Seyit.

681
01:15:33,000 --> 01:15:34,879
Come on, alps!

682
01:15:35,080 --> 01:15:37,559
Keep swinging the glorious swords of Turks!

683
01:15:37,800 --> 01:15:39,479
Beat them all!

684
01:15:39,560 --> 01:15:40,639
Come on!

685
01:15:40,720 --> 01:15:44,639
Whoever attempts to kill us ends up in hell!

686
01:16:01,400 --> 01:16:03,479
The enemy will get ruined!

687
01:16:03,560 --> 01:16:05,199
The state will always prevail!

688
01:16:05,280 --> 01:16:07,319
Allah is the greatest!

689
01:16:24,200 --> 01:16:26,359
What's going on here, Turgut Ghazi?

690
01:16:26,680 --> 01:16:28,799
Who is attacking the tribe?

691
01:16:30,240 --> 01:16:33,479
We ruined the plan of the heathens.

692
01:16:34,440 --> 01:16:37,479
I will explain everything Koca Bey. Don't worry.

693
01:16:42,200 --> 01:16:44,599
Where is your brother Yigit?

694
01:16:48,160 --> 01:16:50,439
I'm here, Turgut Ghazi.

695
01:16:50,680 --> 01:16:52,599
I'm here.

696
01:17:04,400 --> 01:17:07,359
I got shocked like my brother.

697
01:17:08,440 --> 01:17:10,799
You didn't inform us.

698
01:17:12,160 --> 01:17:15,799
Osman Bey is coming!

699
01:17:34,280 --> 01:17:37,919
Osman Bey is bringing the head of the snake.

700
01:17:41,560 --> 01:17:44,479
-Murderer!
-Kill him!

701
01:17:44,600 --> 01:17:46,079
Move!

702
01:17:46,920 --> 01:17:48,479
Murderer!

703
01:18:01,000 --> 01:18:03,799
You took my hatun from me, you dastard.

704
01:18:03,960 --> 01:18:06,679
-It's the day of reckoning.
-Hush, Ghazi.

705
01:18:07,560 --> 01:18:09,079
Dastard!

706
01:18:14,080 --> 01:18:16,399
My Bey will take care of this.

707
01:18:20,440 --> 01:18:22,919
You have done terrible things.

708
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:28,919
The back of Kayi is full of dagger
marks of you and people like you!

709
01:18:31,360 --> 01:18:34,039
You killed the men of many families.

710
01:18:34,560 --> 01:18:37,319
You slaughtered many hatuns!

711
01:18:39,680 --> 01:18:41,959
This is a war, Osman.

712
01:18:42,280 --> 01:18:43,999
A war.

713
01:18:44,800 --> 01:18:47,079
Someone loses.

714
01:18:47,280 --> 01:18:49,239
Someone wins.

715
01:18:50,560 --> 01:18:53,599
This time, you won.

716
01:18:54,160 --> 01:18:56,359
And I lost.

717
01:18:57,960 --> 01:19:00,119
But it isn't over.

718
01:19:00,520 --> 01:19:05,359
Even after centuries,
this war will never be over.

719
01:19:12,760 --> 01:19:15,439
You're going to kill me now.

720
01:19:15,920 --> 01:19:21,839
But Rome will keep
attacking you with all his wrath!

721
01:19:26,080 --> 01:19:29,399
We have enough land to bury you all!

722
01:19:34,040 --> 01:19:38,759
We have enough land to bury you all!

723
01:19:44,360 --> 01:19:49,199
Whoever is born with a sword dies with a sword.

724
01:19:56,600 --> 01:19:58,719
I told you.

725
01:19:59,160 --> 01:20:03,759
I said I would make you learn that...

726
01:20:04,360 --> 01:20:07,039
...while your head was falling on the ground.

727
01:20:24,720 --> 01:20:27,199
Now it's time for justice.

728
01:21:19,040 --> 01:21:22,119
My Beys! My alps!

729
01:21:26,600 --> 01:21:33,439
This dog and people like him
are neither the first nor the last!

730
01:21:33,840 --> 01:21:38,799
People like him are waiting
to attack us in the dark caves!

731
01:21:39,840 --> 01:21:43,879
But we will attack before they do!

732
01:21:47,000 --> 01:21:52,799
And we'll stick these swords into their chests!

733
01:21:54,280 --> 01:21:56,599
Allah is the greatest!

734
01:21:56,680 --> 01:22:01,559
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

735
01:22:01,680 --> 01:22:04,119
Allah is the greatest!

736
01:22:20,800 --> 01:22:22,719
Halime.

737
01:22:35,200 --> 01:22:38,879
Brother, I adorned your sword. Do you like it?

738
01:22:51,480 --> 01:22:56,319
Halime. Are you alright, my sister?

739
01:22:56,840 --> 01:22:58,479
-Brother.
-Yes?

740
01:22:58,840 --> 01:23:03,599
Have you been carrying the
adornment on your sword for years?

741
01:23:04,720 --> 01:23:06,559
How...

742
01:23:07,840 --> 01:23:10,359
Do you remember that?

743
01:23:10,720 --> 01:23:12,999
I do.

744
01:23:13,360 --> 01:23:18,399
You, sister, father, mother and everything.

745
01:23:18,720 --> 01:23:20,679
What are you saying, my sister?

746
01:23:23,440 --> 01:23:25,119
Praise be.

747
01:23:25,600 --> 01:23:28,719
Praise be.

748
01:23:28,800 --> 01:23:30,839
Thanks to my Allah.

749
01:23:31,000 --> 01:23:32,639
I told you.

750
01:23:32,840 --> 01:23:36,799
I said everything would be
alright when drugs lost their effect.

751
01:23:44,280 --> 01:23:45,799
What's going on here?

752
01:23:45,840 --> 01:23:46,999
Come.

753
01:23:47,680 --> 01:23:49,759
Sister.
-Yes?

754
01:23:50,760 --> 01:23:55,599
Why did you pour sand on my head?

755
01:23:59,000 --> 01:24:01,839
-What sand, Halime?
-Just sand.

756
01:24:02,120 --> 01:24:05,999
You used to pour sand on my
head. And they went in my hair.

757
01:24:06,320 --> 01:24:08,839
My mother got angry but you...

758
01:24:10,960 --> 01:24:14,919
Halime, you remember...

759
01:24:15,520 --> 01:24:19,119
She doesn't remember
good things but it's alright.

760
01:24:22,360 --> 01:24:24,959
The snaked called Sofia couldn't win again.

761
01:24:25,120 --> 01:24:27,879
-She will never win.
-Ever.

762
01:24:28,920 --> 01:24:29,959
Well..

763
01:24:30,080 --> 01:24:32,759
Let's go and give our parents the great news.

764
01:24:32,880 --> 01:24:35,679
-Let's go.
-Oh my dear sister.

765
01:24:39,440 --> 01:24:40,919
Let's go.

766
01:24:42,280 --> 01:24:46,039
Deliver this letter to Emperor Andronikos.

767
01:24:48,440 --> 01:24:52,119
Let him know that Claudius
died with his soldiers.

768
01:24:55,000 --> 01:24:57,439
I relied on Claudius.

769
01:24:57,720 --> 01:24:59,959
But he failed, Seyit.

770
01:25:01,080 --> 01:25:02,959
He couldn't do it.

771
01:25:04,040 --> 01:25:05,759
He lost.

772
01:25:06,200 --> 01:25:09,919
Yet I will never give up.

773
01:25:10,320 --> 01:25:12,599
What's in your mind, my Bey?

774
01:25:14,800 --> 01:25:17,919
Iron is forged with hammers, Seyit.

775
01:25:19,320 --> 01:25:21,879
I will talk to Sofia.

776
01:25:22,520 --> 01:25:25,119
I will ally with her.

777
01:25:26,240 --> 01:25:29,839
The hammer here is Sofia.

778
01:25:30,640 --> 01:25:33,599
And she will finish Osman off.

779
01:25:34,320 --> 01:25:39,959
And I will get rid of this tent.

780
01:25:43,120 --> 01:25:46,399
...and own the beylic chair I deserve.

781
01:25:47,520 --> 01:25:50,879
Come on, let's go.

782
01:25:53,480 --> 01:25:56,319
Deliver the news quickly.

783
01:25:56,560 --> 01:25:58,839
Don't get yourself exposed.

784
01:26:09,520 --> 01:26:11,439
Here we go.

785
01:26:23,960 --> 01:26:25,119
Where are you going?

786
01:26:25,200 --> 01:26:28,639
Yigit Bey is sending me to his
tribe. I have things to tell people.

787
01:26:29,560 --> 01:26:32,719
Where is your Bey? What
are you going to tell people?

788
01:26:35,960 --> 01:26:37,759
Get down here.

789
01:26:52,520 --> 01:26:57,119
Is your Bey sending a letter to his people?

790
01:27:01,200 --> 01:27:03,679
I'm just doing what I'm told, Turgut Ghazi.

791
01:27:12,360 --> 01:27:15,039
You filthy-blooded ones.

792
01:27:15,600 --> 01:27:18,159
You are the traitors.

793
01:27:26,320 --> 01:27:31,119
Now you will tell me everything you have done.

794
01:27:31,520 --> 01:27:35,039
Or I will skin you alive.

795
01:27:41,600 --> 01:27:45,799
Osman, we killed one enemy
but the other one is still outside.

796
01:27:46,040 --> 01:27:48,959
We can't be at ease before Sofia dies.

797
01:27:49,240 --> 01:27:51,999
Our alps are searching everywhere, my Bey.

798
01:27:52,200 --> 01:27:54,519
The borders of Bursa are being held too.

799
01:27:54,760 --> 01:27:56,559
We'll find her, God willing.

800
01:27:56,760 --> 01:27:59,439
That snake will curl under a stone, Boran.

801
01:27:59,520 --> 01:28:01,639
You don't know her as well as I do.

802
01:28:01,840 --> 01:28:03,799
Bala, don't worry.

803
01:28:04,280 --> 01:28:06,959
Which enemy has managed to get rid of us so far?

804
01:28:07,040 --> 01:28:10,719
We'll find her. We will. We will.

805
01:28:18,680 --> 01:28:20,519
What's the matter, Turgut Ghazi?

806
01:28:20,600 --> 01:28:22,719
The traitor is Yigit, Osman.

807
01:28:25,200 --> 01:28:28,119
This jackal told me everything.

808
01:28:33,640 --> 01:28:39,359
He made a deal with Claudius
and Sofia for gold and land.

809
01:28:46,720 --> 01:28:49,279
Is that so?

810
01:28:49,720 --> 01:28:53,239
Yigit is the traitor, huh?

811
01:28:57,240 --> 01:28:59,239
May you be cursed.

812
01:28:59,800 --> 01:29:01,759
May you be cursed.

813
01:29:02,520 --> 01:29:08,599
While you beheaded Claudius, I
watched all the Beys one by one.

814
01:29:09,360 --> 01:29:13,919
With the fear that Claudius
might expose his name,

815
01:29:14,000 --> 01:29:16,759
...Yigit tried to hide himself slowly.

816
01:29:16,960 --> 01:29:21,799
That was the moment when
I realized he was the traitor.

817
01:29:22,320 --> 01:29:25,239
Look at me. Look!

818
01:29:27,080 --> 01:29:28,599
Where is he now?

819
01:29:28,880 --> 01:29:31,599
He's gone to meet Sofia, my Bey.

820
01:29:38,280 --> 01:29:42,599
My Bey... What are you thinking about?

821
01:29:42,600 --> 01:29:46,359
Yigit will bring Sofia to us.

822
01:29:46,360 --> 01:29:49,999
They won't die easily.

823
01:29:51,520 --> 01:29:54,039
Now listen to me carefully.

824
01:30:38,440 --> 01:30:40,639
Sofia.

825
01:30:42,800 --> 01:30:44,119
It's me, Yigit.

826
01:30:48,240 --> 01:30:50,439
Claudius told me about this place.

827
01:30:54,480 --> 01:30:56,999
We are on the same side.

828
01:30:57,000 --> 01:30:58,319
Claudius.

829
01:30:58,320 --> 01:30:59,879
Right.

830
01:31:01,200 --> 01:31:03,639
Where is he?

831
01:31:04,480 --> 01:31:07,159
He died.

832
01:31:09,320 --> 01:31:13,679
Osman killed him.

833
01:31:18,200 --> 01:31:20,879
Right...

834
01:31:22,160 --> 01:31:24,879
Yes.

835
01:31:26,280 --> 01:31:32,879
Osman... I swear, I will kill you
and Bala with my own hands.

836
01:31:36,440 --> 01:31:38,679
Sofia.

837
01:31:40,880 --> 01:31:47,319
If you allow me, I want to
share your oath with you.

838
01:31:49,640 --> 01:31:55,319
Claudius died but my cause is not over.

839
01:32:05,720 --> 01:32:08,199
Claudius trusted you.

840
01:32:21,800 --> 01:32:23,439
He was right.

841
01:32:25,560 --> 01:32:26,879
What?

842
01:32:32,720 --> 01:32:37,559
We will set a trap against Osman together.

843
01:32:37,560 --> 01:32:41,399
You will inform me about every step he takes.

844
01:32:41,400 --> 01:32:42,519
Where is he now?

845
01:32:42,520 --> 01:32:45,079
He is in the tribe.

846
01:32:45,080 --> 01:32:48,399
He is celebrating his victory.

847
01:32:48,400 --> 01:32:50,999
And Beys are praising him.

848
01:32:51,760 --> 01:32:56,639
Especially my disgraceful brother...

849
01:32:56,640 --> 01:33:01,999
They will all pay for it.

850
01:33:10,760 --> 01:33:12,279
For revenge..

851
01:33:12,280 --> 01:33:14,359
Yes?

852
01:33:14,360 --> 01:33:17,999
Will you risk everything?

853
01:33:18,000 --> 01:33:19,999
Including your brother?

854
01:33:21,080 --> 01:33:23,159
Don't worry about it.

855
01:33:23,400 --> 01:33:30,239
I will kill that old man with my own hands.

856
01:33:30,240 --> 01:33:34,719
My only dream is to sit on
the seat he stole from me.

857
01:33:34,720 --> 01:33:40,279
You will get more than your dream.

858
01:33:40,280 --> 01:33:44,479
I will kill Osman and Bala
and you'll kill Koca Bey.

859
01:33:47,000 --> 01:33:48,479
And then...

860
01:33:50,160 --> 01:33:55,319
...all the tribes will obey you.

861
01:33:58,320 --> 01:34:01,319
And you will obey the Byzantine.

862
01:34:04,800 --> 01:34:06,879
Now..

863
01:34:06,880 --> 01:34:11,639
Go back to the tribe and keep following them.

864
01:34:11,640 --> 01:34:12,999
Alright.

865
01:34:15,200 --> 01:34:17,039
Alright, I am leaving

866
01:34:29,960 --> 01:34:32,039
Tomorrow, we will hold a meeting.

867
01:34:32,040 --> 01:34:36,199
I will announce the decisions that
will expand our lands to the Beys.

868
01:34:36,200 --> 01:34:39,319
Everything will be ready, my Bey, don't worry.

869
01:34:39,320 --> 01:34:41,599
Thank you, thank you.

870
01:34:41,600 --> 01:34:43,879
What is this, my Osman?

871
01:34:43,880 --> 01:34:45,679
Alaeddin gave this to me.

872
01:34:45,680 --> 01:34:48,439
It will be applied to the wound on your hand.

873
01:34:49,520 --> 01:34:53,239
Alaeddin did not bring it himself
but gave it to his father, huh?

874
01:34:53,240 --> 01:34:54,759
Look at him...

875
01:34:55,960 --> 01:34:58,319
While dealing with all these problems...

876
01:34:58,320 --> 01:35:01,719
...are you worried about this small
wound on my hand. Dark Osman?

877
01:35:01,720 --> 01:35:07,039
You have fallen into my heart.
If even your nail gets hurt, my heart aches.

878
01:35:12,920 --> 01:35:14,719
Here.

879
01:35:14,720 --> 01:35:16,959
This needs to be applied often.

880
01:35:16,960 --> 01:35:19,279
Often.

881
01:35:19,280 --> 01:35:22,599
Come on... Cover it.

882
01:35:22,600 --> 01:35:24,519
Hold it here.

883
01:35:26,000 --> 01:35:28,119
Hold it there.

884
01:35:28,120 --> 01:35:32,319
It used to hurt, but now it's gone.

885
01:35:35,120 --> 01:35:36,959
Look...

886
01:35:37,200 --> 01:35:40,919
What is your concern?

887
01:35:40,920 --> 01:35:44,959
Sofia.

888
01:35:44,960 --> 01:35:46,199
Don't Bala.

889
01:35:46,200 --> 01:35:48,399
Don't look at me like that, Osman.

890
01:35:48,400 --> 01:35:51,839
What if our plan fails? What if it doesn't work?

891
01:35:51,840 --> 01:35:53,359
Don't you trust me?

892
01:35:53,360 --> 01:35:57,119
-I'll find Sofia.
-When did I ever not trust you, my Dark Osman?

893
01:35:57,120 --> 01:36:01,119
If they say there is death behind
this door, I won't leave you alone.

894
01:36:01,120 --> 01:36:04,999
I'll hold your hand and walk with you.

895
01:36:05,000 --> 01:36:07,399
Don't worry.

896
01:36:07,400 --> 01:36:09,319
I will become a shield for you...

897
01:36:09,480 --> 01:36:11,959
And I will not let anyone do anything to you.

898
01:36:12,200 --> 01:36:14,719
It's not about me, Osman. It's about us.

899
01:36:14,720 --> 01:36:17,559
The one we face is a snake after all.

900
01:36:17,560 --> 01:36:21,359
We can never know what she is
going to do. You know her the best.

901
01:36:21,360 --> 01:36:23,599
Sofia doesn't have much time left.

902
01:36:23,600 --> 01:36:30,199
I will make such a plan that neither Yigit
nor Sofia will live long, don't worry.

903
01:36:30,200 --> 01:36:33,279
May Allah help us, my Bey.

904
01:36:33,280 --> 01:36:36,959
May our home and tribe
be filled with joy and peace.

905
01:36:36,960 --> 01:36:40,519
Aameen, my Bala. Aameen.

906
01:36:44,480 --> 01:36:46,119
What did you do?

907
01:36:46,120 --> 01:36:48,719
Did you send the news to the emperor?

908
01:36:48,720 --> 01:36:51,359
I did, my Bey.

909
01:36:51,360 --> 01:36:56,599
To stop Osman's advance...

910
01:37:02,040 --> 01:37:04,799
...the Emperor will take precautions.

911
01:37:04,800 --> 01:37:09,359
These precautions will open
the way to the seat for me, Seyit.

912
01:37:09,360 --> 01:37:12,279
That way might open before
the precautions, my Bey.

913
01:37:12,280 --> 01:37:12,999
How?

914
01:37:13,000 --> 01:37:14,399
I heard from the Alps.

915
01:37:14,400 --> 01:37:19,359
Osman Bey and Bala Hatun will leave
early morning to welcome the migrants.

916
01:37:19,640 --> 01:37:20,999
Allah..

917
01:37:24,120 --> 01:37:28,039
You gave me such good news.

918
01:37:28,040 --> 01:37:33,159
My lion. My lion.

919
01:37:33,160 --> 01:37:38,879
They think that by killing
Claudius, they found peace.

920
01:37:39,800 --> 01:37:43,519
But this comfort will bring them death.

921
01:37:43,520 --> 01:37:48,119
They don't know. Sofia is in Bursa.

922
01:37:48,120 --> 01:37:50,359
Come on then.

923
01:37:50,360 --> 01:37:53,719
Let her hear this news too. Go.

924
01:37:53,720 --> 01:37:57,799
As you order, my Bey.

925
01:38:05,920 --> 01:38:08,319
Tomorrow..

926
01:38:09,680 --> 01:38:15,039
Sofia will kill Osman.

927
01:38:16,160 --> 01:38:22,279
And I will kill my brother under
whose shadow I rotted for years.

928
01:38:26,640 --> 01:38:31,679
The time has come for the prey
and the celebration to be mine.

929
01:38:34,800 --> 01:38:38,439
Show it to your brother. Come on Melikshah!

930
01:38:38,440 --> 01:38:41,879
Come on Alparslan.
Show your brother.

931
01:38:41,880 --> 01:38:45,479
O people! May everyone hear it!

932
01:38:45,920 --> 01:38:47,679
Osman Bey is holding a council.

933
01:38:47,680 --> 01:38:50,719
Do you know why this council is held?

934
01:38:56,200 --> 01:38:59,199
Are you curious about the council, kids?

935
01:38:59,200 --> 01:39:00,999
Yes.

936
01:39:02,360 --> 01:39:07,319
Come and sit with me. Come.

937
01:39:11,240 --> 01:39:12,999
Come.

938
01:39:14,240 --> 01:39:15,799
Come.

939
01:39:21,280 --> 01:39:26,159
We hold councils because decisions
for the state are made at the council.

940
01:39:27,320 --> 01:39:34,679
Talking, consulting, and being
together are the virtues of the Beys.

941
01:39:35,760 --> 01:39:40,199
This meeting is the state's council.

942
01:39:40,200 --> 01:39:44,999
The most important issues and state
affairs are discussed at the council.

943
01:39:45,000 --> 01:39:48,319
As they say, when the council
is held, the tribe grows bigger.

944
01:39:52,520 --> 01:39:54,519
Who holds the council?

945
01:39:55,280 --> 01:39:59,359
The head of the state holds the
council. And that is Osman Bey.

946
01:40:02,120 --> 01:40:04,799
Does Bala Hatun attend the council?

947
01:40:04,800 --> 01:40:09,719
Of course she does. The
lion's wife is also a lion.

948
01:40:10,320 --> 01:40:13,839
And she stands next to her Bey.

949
01:40:14,960 --> 01:40:19,479
I heard from my mother. A state is founded
with the union of a Hatun and a Bey.

950
01:40:22,360 --> 01:40:25,319
Why is food eaten at the council?

951
01:40:25,840 --> 01:40:32,519
Our ancestor Oguz set this tradition.

952
01:40:33,000 --> 01:40:36,679
He said that at the council
the Bey's meal shall be eaten.

953
01:40:37,120 --> 01:40:39,399
State words shall be spoken.

954
01:40:39,760 --> 01:40:42,959
That meal is blessed.

955
01:40:43,920 --> 01:40:48,119
He ordered to follow and
celebrate this tradition.

956
01:40:49,400 --> 01:40:53,439
This is why the Bey's
table is set at the council.

957
01:40:53,440 --> 01:40:57,039
Everyone eats and drinks
and then speaks their words.

958
01:40:58,840 --> 01:41:01,319
Can we join the council?

959
01:41:02,120 --> 01:41:04,599
Of course you can. Of course.

960
01:41:05,000 --> 01:41:09,759
You will grow up and become Beys and Hatuns.

961
01:41:09,760 --> 01:41:13,879
Then all of you will take
your place at the council.

962
01:41:17,880 --> 01:41:21,799
The coming generations
are the guarantee of the state.

963
01:41:22,920 --> 01:41:25,559
We will entrust this state to you.

964
01:41:29,080 --> 01:41:31,479
We founded the state.

965
01:41:31,480 --> 01:41:34,199
From now on you will carry the banner.

966
01:41:37,280 --> 01:41:40,239
Tell me now.

967
01:41:40,240 --> 01:41:43,599
Are you ready for this sacred duty?

968
01:41:43,600 --> 01:41:45,639
We are ready.

969
01:41:46,160 --> 01:41:48,239
Praise be to you.

970
01:41:48,520 --> 01:41:49,879
Praise be.

971
01:41:49,880 --> 01:41:51,599
Praise be to you.

972
01:41:53,040 --> 01:41:55,119
The future of Islam...

973
01:41:55,240 --> 01:41:58,045
...will rise on the
shoulders of brave and

974
01:41:58,057 --> 01:42:01,399
tradition-knowing generations
like you, God willing.

975
01:42:01,400 --> 01:42:04,319
God willing Turgut Gazi.

976
01:42:05,880 --> 01:42:07,799
Praise be to you.

977
01:42:08,520 --> 01:42:12,079
Praise be.

978
01:42:12,080 --> 01:42:15,879
My Bala, our number has
grown a lot with the migrants.

979
01:42:15,880 --> 01:42:17,439
Our burden is heavier now.

980
01:42:17,440 --> 01:42:21,599
Now we need to be more
careful. We will work hard.

981
01:42:21,600 --> 01:42:25,919
We will feed the hungry and make
those who do not have work, work, my Bey.

982
01:42:25,920 --> 01:42:29,039
We will bring an order with
justice and unity, God willing.

983
01:42:29,040 --> 01:42:30,759
God willing, God willing.

984
01:42:30,760 --> 01:42:34,359
This order will develop Mudurnu and Goynuk.

985
01:42:34,360 --> 01:42:36,879
We will build new tribes and new homes.

986
01:42:37,800 --> 01:42:42,359
Every new land is written not only
on the soil but also on us, Osman.

987
01:42:42,360 --> 01:42:46,199
The migrants come with hope,
and we welcome them with effort.

988
01:42:46,200 --> 01:42:51,079
When these two come together,
the state begins to take root.

989
01:42:51,080 --> 01:42:54,479
Taking root is not only done with sword, Bala.

990
01:42:55,080 --> 01:42:59,479
Of course, we have brave Alps and powerful Beys.

991
01:42:59,480 --> 01:43:04,319
But the actual matter is to be a family.

992
01:43:05,320 --> 01:43:08,519
We will encourage our men
and sisters to build families.

993
01:43:08,520 --> 01:43:11,039
We will build their homes together, God willing.

994
01:43:11,040 --> 01:43:12,519
God willing, God willing.

995
01:43:12,520 --> 01:43:16,319
Being a family is not just
about living in a home.

996
01:43:16,320 --> 01:43:20,519
Being a family is about
building half of the state.

997
01:43:29,600 --> 01:43:32,039
My Bala.

998
01:43:32,040 --> 01:43:34,959
Do you remember my words?

999
01:43:42,680 --> 01:43:46,359
Alaca, Osman Bey wants a race.

1000
01:43:48,040 --> 01:43:50,119
Look at me, Iltutan.

1001
01:43:50,360 --> 01:43:51,799
Alaca is too old.

1002
01:43:52,720 --> 01:43:54,439
Don't be hard on her.

1003
01:43:54,600 --> 01:43:56,439
Oh look at him!

1004
01:43:56,640 --> 01:43:59,799
Alaca, Osman Bey seems
to have forgotten your skills.

1005
01:43:59,880 --> 01:44:03,319
-Let's remind him.
-I haven't forgotten anything.

1006
01:44:04,080 --> 01:44:05,479
Alright then.

1007
01:44:05,560 --> 01:44:07,959
Whoever loves most runs fastest.

1008
01:44:08,080 --> 01:44:09,799
How long?

1009
01:44:10,960 --> 01:44:14,319
I know the destination best. Follow me.

1010
01:44:16,520 --> 01:44:20,119
Let's go, girl!

1011
01:44:22,480 --> 01:44:26,439
I will ruin every moment you laugh!

1012
01:44:27,480 --> 01:44:33,119
I swear to God that I will
destroy both you and your wife.

1013
01:44:34,520 --> 01:44:36,359
Soldiers.

1014
01:44:36,560 --> 01:44:39,239
We'll follow them. Come on!

1015
01:44:42,360 --> 01:44:44,639
Today, everything will be over.

1016
01:44:45,160 --> 01:44:47,359
Sofia is going to kill Osman.

1017
01:44:47,480 --> 01:44:49,919
Why did you organize this hunting trip, my Bey?

1018
01:44:49,920 --> 01:44:52,319
Do you think Sofia can do this on her own?

1019
01:44:52,640 --> 01:44:55,119
She has to.

1020
01:44:55,920 --> 01:45:02,799
Osman is going to be hunted by
Sofia and my brother Koca Bey by me.

1021
01:45:03,480 --> 01:45:05,999
Are you going to kill Koca Bey, my Bey?

1022
01:45:09,840 --> 01:45:11,879
Tell the alps to be ready.

1023
01:45:22,120 --> 01:45:23,799
Peace be upon you.

1024
01:45:24,080 --> 01:45:26,119
Peace be upon you too, brother.

1025
01:45:30,400 --> 01:45:32,359
Come here, brother.

1026
01:45:32,800 --> 01:45:35,519
My brave brother.

1027
01:45:39,280 --> 01:45:41,279
Are you ready for hunting, brother?

1028
01:45:41,360 --> 01:45:45,079
You know... Hunting is
my thing. I'm always ready.

1029
01:45:45,320 --> 01:45:46,839
I know.

1030
01:45:46,920 --> 01:45:50,839
Even during the famines, the cauldron
would boil with what you hunted.

1031
01:45:51,040 --> 01:45:53,799
Those days are over.

1032
01:45:53,920 --> 01:45:58,479
The wolf has got too old
but his eyes are still sharp.

1033
01:45:59,000 --> 01:46:01,919
I can still hit the bullseye.

1034
01:46:02,080 --> 01:46:04,359
You can, brother.

1035
01:46:04,480 --> 01:46:06,639
-Give me.
-The arrows.

1036
01:46:08,080 --> 01:46:09,879
After you, brother.

1037
01:46:27,080 --> 01:46:29,319
You aren't so bad, Alaca.

1038
01:46:29,560 --> 01:46:31,119
Not bad.

1039
01:46:31,360 --> 01:46:33,879
He says we aren't so bad, Alaca.

1040
01:46:42,040 --> 01:46:43,559
Come.

1041
01:46:44,680 --> 01:46:46,639
Come.

1042
01:46:52,080 --> 01:46:55,359
We've waited for this day for so long, Osman.

1043
01:46:55,720 --> 01:46:57,279
It will be history, huh?

1044
01:46:57,360 --> 01:47:00,319
Yes, we will keep our promises.

1045
01:47:03,040 --> 01:47:07,519
Today you smile differently.

1046
01:47:08,040 --> 01:47:09,479
You smile differently.

1047
01:47:09,800 --> 01:47:12,759
These eyes only smile for you, my Brunet Osman.

1048
01:47:13,000 --> 01:47:14,919
I don't believe that.

1049
01:47:14,960 --> 01:47:16,679
What's that supposed to mean?

1050
01:47:16,760 --> 01:47:19,439
You used to smile like this when you saw me.

1051
01:47:19,600 --> 01:47:23,679
But now you do it only
when you see your children.

1052
01:47:24,680 --> 01:47:27,799
Do you envy your children, Osman?

1053
01:47:28,440 --> 01:47:31,359
When I look at them, I see you.

1054
01:47:32,000 --> 01:47:35,959
Your part in each of them.
That's why I smile like that.

1055
01:47:36,120 --> 01:47:39,959
When Halime came, your eyes were shining.

1056
01:47:40,280 --> 01:47:42,919
Don't you ever lose that smile.

1057
01:47:43,080 --> 01:47:45,359
Don't you ever lose these smiling eyes.

1058
01:47:55,960 --> 01:48:00,279
I'm sorry. Today is your last day together.

1059
01:48:02,000 --> 01:48:05,119
That isn't possible while I'm here.

1060
01:48:21,280 --> 01:48:24,759
Both of you are going to die today.

1061
01:48:25,600 --> 01:48:28,839
It's you who is going under the ground today.

1062
01:48:31,680 --> 01:48:34,279
Peace be upon you, red witch.

1063
01:48:43,120 --> 01:48:46,959
Sofia's soldiers are going to fall.

1064
01:48:47,080 --> 01:48:49,319
Now what, Sofia?

1065
01:48:51,240 --> 01:48:54,079
I'm going to kill you.

1066
01:48:55,680 --> 01:48:59,119
Soldiers, attack!

1067
01:49:14,720 --> 01:49:18,599
I wanted to join Osman Bey's
council with what I hunted, but...

1068
01:49:19,200 --> 01:49:22,839
...there isn't anything to hunt today, I guess.

1069
01:49:27,920 --> 01:49:30,039
There is.

1070
01:49:31,400 --> 01:49:34,519
And old one to hunt!

1071
01:49:39,040 --> 01:49:42,679
-What are you doing, Yigit?
-Don't come closer!

1072
01:49:52,280 --> 01:49:57,199
Today you are the huntee and I'm the hunter.

1073
01:49:58,360 --> 01:50:00,879
Are you going to kill me?

1074
01:50:01,160 --> 01:50:02,799
Why?

1075
01:50:03,080 --> 01:50:06,239
Why would you do this vile thing?

1076
01:50:10,240 --> 01:50:13,879
I'm tired of withering in your shadow.

1077
01:50:14,000 --> 01:50:16,039
Withering?

1078
01:50:16,280 --> 01:50:19,279
I have a share in everything in your tribe!

1079
01:50:19,720 --> 01:50:22,039
And what do I have in my hands?

1080
01:50:22,320 --> 01:50:23,919
Nothing!

1081
01:50:24,200 --> 01:50:25,959
A huge nothing!

1082
01:50:27,680 --> 01:50:34,839
From which poisonous spring did you drink
water and let the demon capture your heart?

1083
01:50:36,240 --> 01:50:40,479
It seems I raised a snake beside me!

1084
01:50:41,320 --> 01:50:44,359
I'm going to kill you, brother.

1085
01:50:47,680 --> 01:50:49,959
And I will take what is mine.

1086
01:50:53,160 --> 01:50:57,919
Release your arrow! Come on, kill me! Kill me!

1087
01:50:59,560 --> 01:51:01,759
Dastard!

1088
01:51:02,440 --> 01:51:03,279
Shoot me!

1089
01:51:13,120 --> 01:51:17,119
Turgut Ghazi... How did you...

1090
01:51:17,880 --> 01:51:21,439
You jackal disguising as a wolf!

1091
01:51:25,440 --> 01:51:27,479
Your mask has fallen.

1092
01:51:27,800 --> 01:51:30,599
Your betrayal has got exposed.

1093
01:51:31,080 --> 01:51:34,439
Alps, attack.

1094
01:51:37,320 --> 01:51:38,919
Dastards!

1095
01:51:39,640 --> 01:51:41,119
Turgut Ghazi!

1096
01:51:46,720 --> 01:51:48,879
Seyit!

1097
01:51:53,080 --> 01:51:56,319
Your poisonous snake.

1098
01:51:57,240 --> 01:52:01,759
You aren't my brother anymore!

1099
01:52:09,320 --> 01:52:12,959
This dastard didn't betray only you, Koca Bey.

1100
01:52:13,280 --> 01:52:16,839
He also betrayed Osman Bey
by collaborating with Byzantine.

1101
01:52:19,160 --> 01:52:22,679
Did you even do that, dastard?

1102
01:52:25,480 --> 01:52:30,119
His treason will be punished by Osman Bey.

1103
01:52:31,240 --> 01:52:37,199
How can I appear before Osman
Bey with this shame now, Turgut Ghazi?

1104
01:52:46,160 --> 01:52:50,919
Habils won't be blamed for
the things Qabils did, Koca Bey.

1105
01:52:55,400 --> 01:53:01,639
The shame belongs to this
dastard who desired mortal things.

1106
01:53:02,000 --> 01:53:03,639
Move.

1107
01:54:30,040 --> 01:54:31,799
Allah is the greatest!

1108
01:54:38,400 --> 01:54:43,239
Byzantine heathens, death
is the only salvation for you!

1109
01:54:58,280 --> 01:55:01,079
Today I'm going to win, Osman.

1110
01:55:02,600 --> 01:55:05,239
You can't do anything while I'm here.

1111
01:55:24,200 --> 01:55:28,359
I took an oath, Sofia. I'll make you
pay for all the sufferings you caused.

1112
01:55:28,480 --> 01:55:30,879
We'll be even, Bala.

1113
01:55:32,080 --> 01:55:34,559
For the last time.

1114
01:55:45,800 --> 01:55:48,999
I'll make you pay for the
sufferings you gave my daughter.

1115
01:55:49,080 --> 01:55:52,039
I loved her more than you did. She's my daughter.

1116
01:55:52,160 --> 01:55:54,439
You loved her?
You made her bleed!

1117
01:55:54,640 --> 01:55:56,039
You tried to kill her.

1118
01:55:56,200 --> 01:55:58,759
No easy death for you!

1119
01:56:21,760 --> 01:56:23,919
I called you snake but you aren't.

1120
01:56:24,320 --> 01:56:25,919
You are a scorpion.

1121
01:56:26,160 --> 01:56:28,159
A filthy scorpion.

1122
01:56:28,440 --> 01:56:31,839
There is stinging in your nature.

1123
01:56:43,840 --> 01:56:45,319
Bala.

1124
01:56:47,520 --> 01:56:49,799
Bala, leave her.

1125
01:56:53,320 --> 01:56:57,239
Bala, leave her. Come on.

1126
01:57:00,240 --> 01:57:02,519
I will punish her at the tents.

1127
01:57:03,600 --> 01:57:05,999
It's time for you.

1128
01:57:06,640 --> 01:57:07,599
Take her.

1129
01:57:07,720 --> 01:57:10,999
Red demon, your death is here.

1130
01:57:14,440 --> 01:57:16,439
-Are you alright?
-I'm good.

1131
01:57:19,360 --> 01:57:20,839
I'm good

1132
01:57:41,120 --> 01:57:43,159
My dear.

1133
01:57:44,480 --> 01:57:46,719
My baby.

1134
01:57:50,600 --> 01:57:51,799
Look.

1135
01:57:52,640 --> 01:57:55,439
It's spring, my baby.

1136
01:57:57,680 --> 01:57:59,919
Flowers have blossomed.

1137
01:58:00,120 --> 01:58:02,439
They smell beautiful.

1138
01:58:04,000 --> 01:58:07,559
But none of them smells as beautiful as you.

1139
01:58:09,120 --> 01:58:12,559
Nothing can take your place, my baby.

1140
01:58:12,640 --> 01:58:14,279
Nothing can.

1141
01:58:25,720 --> 01:58:27,519
Gonca.

1142
01:58:36,160 --> 01:58:39,119
You sew the daisies, right?

1143
01:58:41,640 --> 01:58:44,759
You see how fast they grew up. Alaaddin?

1144
01:58:47,320 --> 01:58:50,839
Yet our daughter will never grow up.

1145
01:58:52,280 --> 01:58:55,399
You see how fast the daisies grew up. Alaaddin?

1146
01:58:55,560 --> 01:58:58,799
I see, Gonca. I see.

1147
01:59:03,240 --> 01:59:06,999
Daisies are the witnesses of our love, huh?

1148
01:59:07,840 --> 01:59:12,759
I wanted our love to embrace our baby.

1149
01:59:13,960 --> 01:59:16,839
Her parents are always here for her.

1150
01:59:17,240 --> 01:59:19,639
I wanted her to know that.

1151
01:59:25,640 --> 01:59:27,279
I miss her so much.

1152
01:59:27,320 --> 01:59:30,759
Alaaddin, I miss her so much. What will I do?

1153
01:59:31,200 --> 01:59:35,679
I miss our baby so much.

1154
01:59:36,200 --> 01:59:38,479
So do I.

1155
01:59:42,600 --> 01:59:46,119
We'll meet our anger in the afterlife, Gonca.

1156
01:59:46,520 --> 01:59:49,919
We will meet, my baby.

1157
01:59:51,120 --> 01:59:57,959
Alaaddin, I'm so scared of
going through the same suffering.

1158
01:59:58,600 --> 02:00:00,479
I know.

1159
02:00:02,280 --> 02:00:04,879
I know that feeling.

1160
02:00:13,360 --> 02:00:18,479
My Allah will make all our fears disappear.

1161
02:00:22,080 --> 02:00:26,039
When the time comes, we will have children too.

1162
02:00:27,160 --> 02:00:30,799
They will grow our love day by day.

1163
02:00:30,800 --> 02:00:32,519
We will have children, right?

1164
02:00:32,520 --> 02:00:35,879
They will run and play
like others, right, Alaeddin?

1165
02:00:35,880 --> 02:00:40,119
Sure... Sure they will.

1166
02:00:42,200 --> 02:00:44,559
Look, we suffered a lot.

1167
02:00:48,120 --> 02:00:49,759
My Allah...

1168
02:00:51,480 --> 02:00:55,439
My Allah will grant us the greatest joys.

1169
02:00:55,440 --> 02:00:57,999
Don't worry.

1170
02:00:58,000 --> 02:01:00,959
God willing my Alaeddin... God willing.

1171
02:01:16,080 --> 02:01:18,079
My daughter...

1172
02:01:20,400 --> 02:01:23,999
The daisy of her father...

1173
02:01:24,000 --> 02:01:26,879
Your father is here...

1174
02:01:37,120 --> 02:01:40,679
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1175
02:01:40,680 --> 02:01:42,439
My beautiful daughter.

1176
02:01:45,120 --> 02:01:47,679
My daisy...

1177
02:01:59,080 --> 02:02:00,919
Osman.

1178
02:02:01,120 --> 02:02:04,399
Osman killed Claudius.

1179
02:02:04,400 --> 02:02:07,599
Since Sofia did not come, he captured her too.

1180
02:02:07,600 --> 02:02:09,199
Osman.

1181
02:02:09,680 --> 02:02:13,999
His end will not come before
we turn the frontiers into hell.

1182
02:02:14,000 --> 02:02:15,559
Get ready.

1183
02:02:15,560 --> 02:02:18,079
We are returning to Constantinople.

1184
02:02:18,080 --> 02:02:21,239
Without wasting time, I will gather the Senate.

1185
02:02:21,240 --> 02:02:27,279
I will strike him from the place he least
expects, and we will become Osman's hell.

1186
02:02:27,280 --> 02:02:28,879
His hell!

1187
02:02:34,960 --> 02:02:37,559
My Bey caught Sofia!

1188
02:02:37,560 --> 02:02:40,519
You will die, demon!

1189
02:02:40,600 --> 02:02:41,759
Sofia..

1190
02:02:46,000 --> 02:02:48,559
Justice will finally be provided, sister.

1191
02:02:50,720 --> 02:02:54,319
Traitor!

1192
02:02:54,440 --> 02:02:55,519
You dastard!

1193
02:02:55,520 --> 02:02:59,719
Infidel! You will die!

1194
02:03:04,480 --> 02:03:06,199
Walk!

1195
02:03:13,040 --> 02:03:15,039
Come on!

1196
02:03:26,160 --> 02:03:30,079
Soon, you will pay for
everything you have done, Sofia.

1197
02:03:30,080 --> 02:03:32,279
O, people of Kayi.

1198
02:03:32,400 --> 02:03:39,279
The day we will take revenge from Sofia,
who has caused us so much pain, has come.

1199
02:03:41,080 --> 02:03:45,279
Poena, forgive me...

1200
02:03:45,280 --> 02:03:46,719
My anger blinded my eyes.

1201
02:03:46,720 --> 02:03:48,679
I never wanted to hurt you.

1202
02:03:48,680 --> 02:03:49,799
I would never do that.

1203
02:03:49,800 --> 02:03:53,199
You will never be forgiven, Sofia.
You will die the way you deserve!

1204
02:03:53,200 --> 02:03:54,959
I am not talking to you Bala!

1205
02:03:59,160 --> 02:04:01,079
My little bird...

1206
02:04:04,320 --> 02:04:07,679
Will you forgive me?

1207
02:04:14,520 --> 02:04:18,399
This woman destroyed many families!

1208
02:04:18,480 --> 02:04:23,839
She left many mothers
childless, many valiants graveless!

1209
02:04:25,840 --> 02:04:33,159
This woman brought darkness,
cruelty, and betrayal to these lands.

1210
02:04:36,720 --> 02:04:39,319
I wanted you to see...

1211
02:04:39,320 --> 02:04:43,599
...and know this.

1212
02:04:43,880 --> 02:04:50,759
In Kayi tribe, justice is not served in secret!

1213
02:04:50,760 --> 02:04:55,319
Whoever oppresses others
will pay for it in this square.

1214
02:05:03,560 --> 02:05:05,479
Uncle..

1215
02:05:06,480 --> 02:05:08,239
What is happening, brothers?

1216
02:05:08,240 --> 02:05:12,119
Is that him?

1217
02:05:17,000 --> 02:05:22,119
This is the traitor who spied for Claudius.

1218
02:05:29,040 --> 02:05:31,679
He told me everything one by one.

1219
02:05:37,120 --> 02:05:38,759
Is that so?

1220
02:05:41,960 --> 02:05:43,039
Koca Bey.

1221
02:05:45,200 --> 02:05:47,479
Don't bow your head...

1222
02:05:49,320 --> 02:05:53,519
I am ashamed to look at your face, Osman Bey.

1223
02:05:54,080 --> 02:05:57,119
I brought this traitor dog to your presence.

1224
02:05:57,280 --> 02:05:59,559
Now I am leaving.

1225
02:05:59,560 --> 02:06:02,479
No, stop!

1226
02:06:10,280 --> 02:06:11,039
We..

1227
02:06:12,680 --> 02:06:18,039
We know who is innocent and who is guilty.

1228
02:06:22,080 --> 02:06:23,799
Stand tall.

1229
02:06:25,960 --> 02:06:31,039
Forgive me, my Bey, I did it,
but you show your greatness.

1230
02:06:31,040 --> 02:06:33,519
Shut up you coward dog!

1231
02:06:33,520 --> 02:06:36,479
At least die with honor.

1232
02:06:36,480 --> 02:06:37,839
Traitor!

1233
02:06:41,520 --> 02:06:43,639
How many coins did you sell us for?

1234
02:06:43,640 --> 02:06:46,599
I didn't sell anyone, my Bey.

1235
02:06:46,600 --> 02:06:49,999
Claudius threatened me with my life.

1236
02:06:50,000 --> 02:06:52,759
So many innocent people lost their lives.

1237
02:06:52,760 --> 02:06:55,359
So many Turks' blood was spilled.

1238
02:06:55,360 --> 02:06:56,519
Forgive me.

1239
02:06:56,520 --> 02:06:57,639
No

1240
02:06:58,320 --> 02:07:02,519
The state is as great as the
punishment it gives to a traitor.

1241
02:07:04,920 --> 02:07:12,039
For those who betray their state and nation,
the shadow of this holy banner is forbidden.

1242
02:07:14,880 --> 02:07:19,839
Your punishment is this sword that goes
in clean and comes out covered in blood.

1243
02:07:29,760 --> 02:07:31,759
Here..

1244
02:07:33,880 --> 02:07:39,679
Whoever betrays us will
meet the same fate as this dog.

1245
02:07:43,440 --> 02:07:45,319
Now it's your turn.

1246
02:08:02,320 --> 02:08:05,999
I bear witness that there is none
worthy of worship except Allah....

1247
02:08:07,600 --> 02:08:13,959
...and I bear witness that Muhammad
is His servant and Messenger.

1248
02:08:29,080 --> 02:08:31,199
You snake..

1249
02:08:34,000 --> 02:08:37,039
Devil! You're playing games again, Sofia.

1250
02:08:42,800 --> 02:08:45,599
I understood when I was at hell's threshold.

1251
02:08:46,440 --> 02:08:50,639
No revenge can save my soul.

1252
02:08:50,640 --> 02:08:53,119
I know it's too late for that.

1253
02:09:01,800 --> 02:09:04,279
I found the right path.

1254
02:09:04,280 --> 02:09:07,799
Father, this snake is playing a game again.

1255
02:09:07,800 --> 02:09:09,319
Look at me.

1256
02:09:15,000 --> 02:09:17,039
The decision is yours, Osman Bey.

1257
02:09:23,760 --> 02:09:26,839
Take her to the caged tent.

1258
02:09:30,600 --> 02:09:32,639
Take her!

1259
02:10:10,440 --> 02:10:13,319
You played your game again, Sofia.

1260
02:10:13,320 --> 02:10:16,839
No more games, Gonca.

1261
02:10:17,760 --> 02:10:22,119
I don't believe you, Sofia.
You're playing games again.

1262
02:10:22,120 --> 02:10:24,799
Maybe you changed me.

1263
02:10:28,520 --> 02:10:32,279
Walk, Sofia, come on. Come on, walk.

1264
02:10:37,200 --> 02:10:40,959
So my eyes have seen that
the red witch became a Muslim...

1265
02:10:40,960 --> 02:10:43,559
That witch may be lying out of fear.

1266
02:10:43,560 --> 02:10:46,199
I expect anything from this Sofia snake.

1267
02:10:46,200 --> 02:10:51,479
Osman Bey will make the right decision.

1268
02:10:54,160 --> 02:10:56,879
We all know what she did to us.

1269
02:10:57,840 --> 02:10:59,799
Now she says she believes Islam.

1270
02:11:00,880 --> 02:11:02,879
Tell me.

1271
02:11:02,880 --> 02:11:04,679
What do you think?

1272
02:11:08,840 --> 02:11:13,279
That snake left us helpless.

1273
02:11:14,120 --> 02:11:17,999
Doesn't her faith look like the Pharaoh's faith?

1274
02:11:18,000 --> 02:11:19,599
What if she is lying again?

1275
02:11:19,600 --> 02:11:24,439
Pharaoh repented but he was not granted faith.

1276
02:11:26,000 --> 02:11:27,719
This is different.

1277
02:11:29,320 --> 02:11:31,199
True.

1278
02:11:31,200 --> 02:11:34,919
We heard the shahada from Sofia.

1279
02:11:35,080 --> 02:11:36,119
My heart knows.

1280
02:11:36,120 --> 02:11:38,759
I know, that snake is playing a game again but...

1281
02:11:38,760 --> 02:11:41,999
But it is the Prophet's sunnah.

1282
02:11:43,440 --> 02:11:47,079
We can't take her heart
out and check what is inside.

1283
02:11:47,640 --> 02:11:53,159
Only Allah knows if her
intention is sincere or not.

1284
02:11:53,160 --> 02:11:55,559
Will we forgive her now?

1285
02:11:55,560 --> 02:11:59,119
Father, isn't she going to
pay for all the things she did?

1286
02:12:00,640 --> 02:12:03,399
If she really believed..

1287
02:12:05,040 --> 02:12:07,799
...then it means Sofia died anyway.

1288
02:12:07,800 --> 02:12:11,679
She may been born again without a sin.

1289
02:12:11,680 --> 02:12:17,719
When my Allah gives new life to those
who repent, how can we stand against that?

1290
02:12:17,720 --> 02:12:23,119
But we must be careful until
we are sure she is not lying.

1291
02:12:23,120 --> 02:12:26,359
Of course. Of course, we will do that.

1292
02:12:26,360 --> 02:12:31,199
We will take all measures to
find out if she tells the truth or lies.

1293
02:12:31,560 --> 02:12:35,039
But until then, she will stay in the caged tent.

1294
02:12:36,720 --> 02:12:41,079
She will live according
to the rules of Islamic law.

1295
02:12:41,080 --> 02:12:43,559
My Bey, can I come in?

1296
02:12:43,560 --> 02:12:46,559
Come in.

1297
02:12:48,640 --> 02:12:52,919
My Bey, all Beys are here as you ordered.

1298
02:12:52,920 --> 02:12:54,519
We are ready for the council.

1299
02:13:01,960 --> 02:13:03,319
Attention!

1300
02:13:03,320 --> 02:13:07,719
Osman Bey the ruler!

1301
02:13:09,960 --> 02:13:11,239
Peace be upon you.

1302
02:13:11,400 --> 02:13:14,919
Peace be upon you too.

1303
02:13:26,960 --> 02:13:27,839
My Beys.

1304
02:13:28,840 --> 02:13:29,839
My sisters.

1305
02:13:30,640 --> 02:13:31,919
My Alps.

1306
02:13:32,760 --> 02:13:38,159
On the path we took with Turkishness
as our body and Islam as our soul...

1307
02:13:38,160 --> 02:13:42,879
...we never stopped fighting
to bring an order to the world.

1308
02:13:42,880 --> 02:13:48,279
Whenever we saw the tears of the oppressed
we were always worried about them.

1309
02:13:48,280 --> 02:13:50,159
We helped them, thank Allah.

1310
02:13:50,400 --> 02:13:53,199
Thank Allah.

1311
02:13:53,200 --> 02:13:57,279
We defeated many infidels,
and we were defeated by many.

1312
02:13:57,280 --> 02:14:01,199
But we never stayed back from war.

1313
02:14:03,760 --> 02:14:06,759
We expanded our lands.

1314
02:14:06,760 --> 02:14:09,599
We conquered many castles.

1315
02:14:09,600 --> 02:14:14,759
We conquered these castles to spread justice.

1316
02:14:16,680 --> 02:14:18,159
And now..

1317
02:14:19,280 --> 02:14:25,439
...the time has come to give these castles to
the reliable Beys whose justice will not fail.

1318
02:14:31,680 --> 02:14:33,519
Boran.

1319
02:14:42,000 --> 02:14:44,879
Koca Bey, come here.

1320
02:14:52,800 --> 02:14:55,119
Goynuk is under your command.

1321
02:14:55,400 --> 02:14:58,039
Rule with justice.

1322
02:15:01,320 --> 02:15:05,639
You give the orders and I obey, my Bey.

1323
02:15:06,000 --> 02:15:09,319
I will just look after what is yours.

1324
02:15:09,440 --> 02:15:10,959
Thank you, thank you.

1325
02:15:11,160 --> 02:15:13,159
Have a seat, Koca Bey.

1326
02:15:14,880 --> 02:15:18,079
Hasan Bey, come here.

1327
02:15:27,680 --> 02:15:31,879
Mudurnu is under your command. Rule with merit.

1328
02:15:32,840 --> 02:15:37,319
My Bey, I will rule Mudurnu
with justice and mercy.

1329
02:15:37,640 --> 02:15:40,759
-Thank you.
-Thank you. Have a seat.

1330
02:15:47,680 --> 02:15:50,119
Well, Alaaddin...

1331
02:15:51,080 --> 02:15:53,879
Come here, son.

1332
02:16:06,760 --> 02:16:08,199
My Bey.

1333
02:16:08,920 --> 02:16:14,199
The castle of Akhisar will have the
honor of having a Shahzade's justice.

1334
02:16:15,640 --> 02:16:19,359
Son, the castle of Akhisar is yours.

1335
02:16:22,560 --> 02:16:28,079
What my Beys points out, my
cause, is my most precious treasure.

1336
02:16:28,600 --> 02:16:30,359
Thank you, my Bey.

1337
02:16:30,560 --> 02:16:32,638
You're welcome.

1338
02:16:44,400 --> 02:16:46,477
Hristo, come here.

1339
02:16:53,840 --> 02:17:00,279
Well... Some never wake up
from the sleep of the wrong.

1340
02:17:00,440 --> 02:17:04,519
But you found the right way.

1341
02:17:04,840 --> 02:17:09,759
You will take care of the
Greek people in my lands.

1342
02:17:09,840 --> 02:17:12,999
Tell them about the justice of Kayi.

1343
02:17:15,520 --> 02:17:18,519
-May your duty be blessed.
-Thank you, Osman Bey.

1344
02:17:18,638 --> 02:17:21,839
I will tell all of them about the
love and mercy I saw in you.

1345
02:17:22,040 --> 02:17:23,317
Thank you.

1346
02:17:29,959 --> 02:17:33,798
Osman Bey, you have pleased all of us.

1347
02:17:34,160 --> 02:17:37,798
We were nomads. Thanks to you, we own lands now.

1348
02:17:38,240 --> 02:17:41,879
But I've heard the bad news.

1349
02:17:42,120 --> 02:17:46,359
They say the emperor is marching
towards us with all his strength.

1350
02:17:55,120 --> 02:17:57,397
Let him come.

1351
02:17:58,160 --> 02:18:00,239
We are a high plane tree.

1352
02:18:00,400 --> 02:18:04,519
We won't fall with wind.

1353
02:18:04,840 --> 02:18:06,039
Let them come.

1354
02:18:06,160 --> 02:18:09,239
We have enough land to
bury them all, thank Allah.

1355
02:18:09,280 --> 02:18:11,839
Thank Allah.

1356
02:18:11,959 --> 02:18:15,439
My old heart wonders something, Osman Bey.

1357
02:18:16,000 --> 02:18:20,079
You said everything except our new target.

1358
02:18:20,360 --> 02:18:24,039
Tell us where to ride.

1359
02:18:25,520 --> 02:18:28,359
My Beys whose hearts are full of faith!

1360
02:18:28,840 --> 02:18:31,638
The new target isn't only a place...

1361
02:18:31,799 --> 02:18:35,879
...but all the lands where the sun descends!

1362
02:18:36,558 --> 02:18:41,477
I swear to Allah that I will
never stop fighting for this cause.

1363
02:18:44,600 --> 02:18:47,119
Allah is the greatest!

1364
02:18:47,200 --> 02:18:52,718
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

1365
02:19:00,320 --> 02:19:02,199
Forgive me, Allah

1366
02:19:08,718 --> 02:19:11,759
You remember the prayers only now, Sofia?

1367
02:19:12,320 --> 02:19:13,919
Allah..

1368
02:19:19,440 --> 02:19:22,439
There is nothing to do for me but praying, Bala.

1369
02:19:23,638 --> 02:19:26,959
Do you remember only when your way ends?

1370
02:19:29,680 --> 02:19:32,199
The biggest punishment for people...

1371
02:19:43,080 --> 02:19:46,999
...is staying alone with themselves, Bala.

1372
02:19:50,480 --> 02:19:52,679
I don't believe you, Sofia

1373
02:19:53,120 --> 02:19:57,799
Will you pretend to be a believer
and start causing unrest again?

1374
02:19:58,120 --> 02:20:01,479
I've just realized that I have nothing but Poena.

1375
02:20:04,160 --> 02:20:08,199
I mean Halime.

1376
02:20:09,040 --> 02:20:11,039
I know.

1377
02:20:12,240 --> 02:20:15,639
I know that even she isn't mine.

1378
02:20:17,160 --> 02:20:19,839
For the first time I'm unmasked.

1379
02:20:20,160 --> 02:20:22,759
Sofia.

1380
02:20:24,640 --> 02:20:26,199
Bala.

1381
02:20:27,080 --> 02:20:31,839
Today, for the first time, I saw
Allah inside me Who you believed in.

1382
02:20:35,720 --> 02:20:38,199
Will He accept me?

1383
02:20:41,080 --> 02:20:43,639
Will He forgive me, Bala?

1384
02:20:43,920 --> 02:20:48,599
Forgiving isn't up to us, but to Allah.

1385
02:20:49,240 --> 02:20:52,399
I can't measure your words,
but your intention.

1386
02:20:52,560 --> 02:20:53,879
My intention is real.

1387
02:20:54,000 --> 02:20:58,759
I don't seek vengeance but a path.
I know you will never forgive me.

1388
02:20:58,800 --> 02:21:02,479
But I need your guidance.

1389
02:21:06,280 --> 02:21:08,039
Bala.

1390
02:21:09,040 --> 02:21:11,599
Will you help me?

1391
02:22:17,480 --> 02:22:20,279
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1392
02:22:21,520 --> 02:22:25,239
Come on. Here we go!

1393
02:22:27,920 --> 02:22:29,799
O my nation!

1394
02:22:29,880 --> 02:22:33,419
Since the day when the
truth called out from Hira Mountain,

1395
02:22:33,431 --> 02:22:36,839
...we have never
abandoned the right way.

1396
02:22:40,560 --> 02:22:45,079
We haven't gone beyond the
way our Prophet opened.

1397
02:22:45,760 --> 02:22:51,519
The plane tree growing up in my chest
became a dream of conquest for us.

1398
02:22:53,760 --> 02:22:59,039
We stood ready for cruelty, torture and defeats.

1399
02:22:59,360 --> 02:23:04,559
We wanted the Islam world
to be united and strong.

1400
02:23:05,040 --> 02:23:09,079
In this era where the hopes
are growing, I have an oath.

1401
02:23:09,560 --> 02:23:14,959
We'll spread the words of
Allah in more seas and lands.

1402
02:23:17,320 --> 02:23:23,119
Wherever an innocent cries,
we'll arise there like a thunderbolt!

1403
02:23:27,760 --> 02:23:30,719
And we will shout out to the whole world.

1404
02:23:32,840 --> 02:23:37,479
Justice forever.
Freedom forever.